noreferrer noopener\">版本2源码下载</a></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/buttons --><span>[/hidecontent]</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->','易支付源码搭建教程｜0基础小白搭建｜从入门到精通','','publish','open','open','','%e6%98%93%e6%94%af%e4%bb%98%e6%90%ad%e5%bb%ba%e6%95%99%e7%a8%8b%ef%bd%9c0%e5%9f%ba%e7%a1%80%e5%b0%8f%e7%99%bd%e6%90%ad%e5%bb%ba%ef%bd%9c%e4%bb%8e%e5%85%a5%e9%97%a8%e5%88%b0%e7%b2%be%e9%80%9a','','','2023-07-14 02:26:39','2023-07-13 18:26:39','',0,'https://HF.xn--i8s34n4wz.xyz/?p=559',0,'post','',1),(562,1,'2022-12-21 05:38:00','2022-12-20 21:38:00','<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":500,\"height\":500,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230411/20230411_1681168192.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/buttons {\"alignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div data-quantity=\"1\" data-radius=\"true\" style=\"text-align:center\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-buttons radius\"><span class=\"an_1 but hollow c-green\"><a href=\"https://store.hfz.pw/buy/67\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://store.hfz.pw/buy/67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">点击前往代搭建</a></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>PagerMaid-Pyro 现已开始公测</strong></span></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><code><a href=\"https://telegra.ph/PagerMaid-Plugins-11-27\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://telegra.ph/PagerMaid-Plugins-11-27\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">插件介绍</a></code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">介绍<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>PagerMaid-Pyro 是一个开源的 Telegram 人形自走 Bot 方案，功能强大而丰富，可以帮助你打造专属的便利功能。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>本 Wiki 主要详细说明搭建的流程和注意事项，以便各位用户依此搭建属于自己的 Userbot 。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>由于资金有限和部分依赖包的安装方便性，这里主要提供&nbsp;<code>Ubuntu</code>、<code>Debian</code>、<code>wsl</code>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<code>Arch Linux</code>&nbsp;的安装过程。（欢迎其他用户提供其他系统的搭建方法）</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">鉴于上游依赖 Telethon 已经超过半年没有发版，许多新功能无法进行适配，所以更换到了 Pyrogram 来实现新功能，需要注意的是：目前许多功能仍然在适配中。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>与旧版的不同（示例）：<code>命令前缀 - 改为 ,</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>全平台支持</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TG 新功能适配</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>多人共用，一人造福群友</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230414/20230414_1681421624.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230414/20230414_1681421634.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">准备</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">服务器/VPS一台</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\"><code>Centos7、Ubuntu 18/20系统</code>都可以，没有服务器的可点击下方本站出售的服务器。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"288\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"288\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">TG-API信息准备</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">然后去 <strong><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://my.telegram.org/\" target=\"_blank\">telegram 官网</a> </strong>生成 <code>api</code> 填入配置文件内，我们只需要复制 <code>api id</code> 和 <code>api_hash</code> 值 填入 <code>api_key</code> 和 <code>api_hash</code> 。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FinalShell安装好</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">SSH连接工具下载好，可直接<a href=\"https://www.baidu.com/link?url=vbdjmQK0RFpIZez8vgsjHbR0_NcCWtN9mjac9mYZyocjsS8vBUz5rsB7zu_rz1Kh&amp;wd=&amp;eqid=e883448c00067ba00000000663a22ab9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>官网下载</strong></a>。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">安装</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n<div data-type=\"payshow\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-hide-content\"><span>[hidecontent type=\"payshow\"]</span><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><code><a href=\"https://xtaolabs.com\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://xtaolabs.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">原项目地址</a></code><br>源码下载：</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamPGM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/TeamPGM</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Docker 一键安装：</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamPGM/PagerMaid-Pyro/development/utils/docker.sh -O docker.sh &amp;&amp; chmod +x docker.sh &amp;&amp; bash docker.sh</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter --><span>[/hidecontent]</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->','TG人形机器人｜PagerMaid-Pyro｜搭建教程与介绍','','publish','open','open','','tg%e4%ba%ba%e5%bd%a2%e6%9c%ba%e5%99%a8%e4%ba%ba%f0%9f%a4%96%ef%b8%8f%ef%bd%9cpagermaid-pyr%ef%bd%9c%e6%90%ad%e5%bb%ba%e6%95%99%e7%a8%8b%e4%b8%8e%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d','','','2023-04-14 06:49:20','2023-04-13 22:49:20','',0,'https://HF.xn--i8s34n4wz.xyz/?p=562',0,'post','',0),(615,1,'2022-12-25 05:11:04','0000-00-00 00:00:00','2333','sspanel-malio','','draft','open','open','','','','','2022-12-25 05:11:04','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://HF.xn--i8s34n4wz.xyz/?p=615',0,'post','',0),(617,1,'2023-04-01 04:22:07','2023-03-31 20:22:07','<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/skx@0.1.3/img/uim-logo-round.png\" alt=\"logo\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">SSPanel UIM</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Across the Great Wall we can reach every corner in the world</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/x86-9cf\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/x86_64-red\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ARM_64-ff69b4\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ARM_v7-yellow\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ARM_v6-green\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/PowerPC_64_le-blueviolet\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/IBM_Z-blue\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Description</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>构建自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Anankke/SSPanel-Uim\">SSPanel-UIM</a>, 添加了以下功能:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>多架构支持</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>傻瓜化配置 (无需任何多余设置开箱即用!)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>自动初始化数据库</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>自动更新 IP 数据库、下载客户端、初始化管理员账户</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>自豪地使用 Apache 作为服务器程序</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Todo List:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>解决 “流媒体解锁” 页面的 Error 问题</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>新增时区设置, 新增用户权限设置</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>允许变量控制 php 内存大小设置</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>增加更多主题的镜像</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Parameter</strong></th><th><strong>Function</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>PATH_TO_SITE</td><td>SSPanel 以及数据库存放路径</td></tr><tr><td>SSPANEL_KEY</td><td>修改此字符串到一随机数值以保证网站安全</td></tr><tr><td>SSPANEL_BASEURL</td><td>用于外部访问的网站域名</td></tr><tr><td>SSPANEL_MUKEY</td><td>用于校验魔改后端请求，可以随意修改，但请保持前后端一致，否则节点不能工作</td></tr><tr><td>SSPANEL_APPNAME</td><td>站点名称, 默认为&nbsp;<code>SSPanel-UIM</code></td></tr><tr><td>SSPANEL_ADMIN_EMAIL</td><td>管理员账户邮箱, 用于脚本自动创建账户<br>除非你已经手动创建过账户, 否则强烈建议填写!</td></tr><tr><td>SSPANEL_ADMIN_PASSWORD</td><td>管理员账户密码, 用于脚本自动创建账户<br>除非你已经手动创建过账户, 否则强烈建议填写!</td></tr><tr><td>SSPANEL_DEBUG</td><td>可选, 默认为 0<br>生产环境请保持为 0</td></tr><tr><td>DB_HOST</td><td>数据库地址</td></tr><tr><td>DB_PORT</td><td>数据库端口, 默认为&nbsp;<code>3306</code></td></tr><tr><td>DB_DATABASE</td><td>数据库名称, 默认为&nbsp;<code>sspanel</code><br>建议修改以保证安全</td></tr><tr><td>DB_USERNAME</td><td>数据库用户名, 默认为&nbsp;<code>root</code></td></tr><tr><td>DB_PASSWORD</td><td>数据库密码</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">一、前置要求</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">耐心</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>安装需要花费许多时间，有可能还会安装失败，需要重来，确保你有足够的耐心和时间</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">基础知识</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果你什么都不懂，比如连端口都不知道怎么放行，Linux 常见命令也不会，遇到问题也不会 Google，建议你先学习好相关知识再来</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">域名一个</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>确保你对域名解析等概念和操作比较熟悉，这里不会教你这些内容。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">VPS 系统要求</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cent OS 7 及以上<br>Ubuntu 16 及以上<br>Debian 9 及以上</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">前端 VPS 配置要求</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1 CPU 以上<br>1 G 内存及以上，推荐 2 G 及以上<br>10 G 硬盘空间及以上</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">后端 VPS 配置要求</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>没有硬性要求，取决于后端需要运行多少用户</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">二、安装宝塔</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cent OS</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">yum install -y wget &amp;&amp; wget -O install.sh http://download.bt.cn/install/install_6.0.sh &amp;&amp; sh install.sh</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ubuntu</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">wget -O install.sh http://download.bt.cn/install/install-ubuntu_6.0.sh &amp;&amp; sudo bash install.sh\n</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Debian</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">wget -O install.sh http://download.bt.cn/install/install-ubuntu_6.0.sh &amp;&amp; bash install.sh</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>等待脚本运行完成，完成后脚本会输出宝塔面板访问地址和宝塔用户名密码，进入浏览器登录即可。如果打不开的话，那就是防火墙没放行，这个要到 VPS 商家面板里放行。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">三、安装 SSPanel Uim</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">安装 LNMP</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>登录宝塔后会提示安装 LNMP，我们这里选择安装 Nginx、MySQL、PHP、phpMyAdmin，注意版本不要选错。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nginx 1.18</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>MySQL 5.6</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>PHP-7.4</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>phpMyAdmin - 4.9</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>PureFTPd（可选）<br>点击一键安装后宝塔会在后台进行安装，这个过程比较久，可能需要十几分钟，安装完成后再继续下面的教程。</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://blog.sprov.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/blog.sprov.xyz-sspanel-uim-soga-v2ray-trojan-image-2.png\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>安装 LNMP</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">配置 PHP</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>进入&lt;软件商店&gt;，找到刚刚安装的 PHP 7.4，点击设置<br><img src=\"https://blog.sprov.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/blog.sprov.xyz-sspanel-uim-soga-v2ray-trojan-image-3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>设置php<br>删除如图所示的函数。<code>system</code>&nbsp;<code>putenv</code>&nbsp;<code>popen</code>&nbsp;<code>proc_open</code><br><img src=\"https://blog.sprov.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/blog.sprov.xyz-sspanel-uim-soga-v2ray-trojan-image-8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>删除禁用函数</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">部署 SSPanel Uim</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">创建站点</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>选择&lt;网站&gt;，点击添加站点<br><img src=\"https://blog.sprov.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/blog.sprov.xyz-sspanel-uim-soga-v2ray-trojan-image-5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>添加站点<br>这里假设你的域名为 aaa.com，并且已经将 www.aaa.com 解析到了 VPS 的 IP 地址上，按照以下配置创建站点。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>数据库用户名和密码可以自定义。<strong>数据库选择utf-8mb4编码</strong><br><img src=\"https://blog.sprov.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/blog.sprov.xyz-sspanel-uim-soga-v2ray-trojan-image-6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>创建站点<br>创建站点后会帮你创建数据库，数据库名默认和你的数据库用户名一样，注意不要搞混。<br><img src=\"https://blog.sprov.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/blog.sprov.xyz-sspanel-uim-soga-v2ray-trojan-image-7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>创建成功</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">安装 SSPanel Uim</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>自行将命令中的&lt;域名&gt;替换为创建站点时的域名，教程里是 www.aaa.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>进入站点目录，并删除自动创建的文件</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cd /www/wwwroot/域名/\nrm * -rf</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>下载 SSPanel Uim 最新版</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下两条命令只运行一个，根据你的需要进行选择</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\"># 下载 master 分支，代码很久没更新了，不建议使用\ngit clone -b master https://github.com/Anankke/SSPanel-Uim.git tmp &amp;&amp; mv tmp/.git . &amp;&amp; rm -rf tmp &amp;&amp; git reset --hard\n\n# 下载 dev 分支\ngit clone -b dev https://github.com/Anankke/SSPanel-Uim.git tmp &amp;&amp; mv tmp/.git . &amp;&amp; rm -rf tmp &amp;&amp; git reset --hard</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>安装SSPanel Uim，注意替换&lt;域名&gt;替换为创建站点时的域名，教程里是 www.aaa.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">git config core.filemode false\nwget https://getcomposer.org/installer -O composer.phar\nphp composer.phar\nphp composer.phar install\ncp config/.config.example.php config/.config.php\ncp config/appprofile.example.php config/appprofile.php\ncd ../\nchmod -R 755 域名/\nchown -R www:www 域名/\nln -s /www/wwwroot/域名/sql/glzjin_all.sql /www/backup/database/</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">修改站点</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>点击&nbsp;<strong>网站</strong>&nbsp;最右侧的设置，在&nbsp;<strong>网站目录</strong>&nbsp;里取消&nbsp;<strong>防跨站攻击</strong>，运行目录里面选择 /public，点击&nbsp;<strong>保存</strong>。<br>在&nbsp;<strong>伪静态</strong>&nbsp;中填入下面内容：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">location / {\n    try_files $uri /index.php$is_args$args;\n}</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">导入数据库</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果这里没出现文件，那么则运行此命令：ln -s /www/wwwroot/域名/sql/glzjin_all.sql /www/backup/database/<br>去数据库 点&nbsp;<strong>导入</strong>&nbsp;选择&nbsp;<strong>glzjin_all.sql</strong>&nbsp;导入</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">配置 config</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>该文件需要配置许多东西，这里只讲基本配置，确保网站能够正常运行，其它的配置可以自行查看配置文件里的说明进行配置<br><img src=\"https://blog.sprov.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/blog.sprov.xyz-sspanel-uim-soga-v2ray-trojan-image-9.png\" alt=\"\"><br>配置以下内容后，<strong>记得保存</strong>，注意根据你实际情况进行配置，不要跟我的一样<br><img src=\"https://blog.sprov.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/blog.sprov.xyz-sspanel-uim-soga-v2ray-trojan-image-11.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">创建管理员账号以及其它初始化工作</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cd /www/wwwroot/域名/\nphp xcat User createAdmin\nphp xcat User resetTraffic\nphp xcat SyncRadius syncusers\nphp xcat Tool initQQWry\nphp xcat Tool initdownload</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">配置定时任务</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行&nbsp;<code>crontab -e</code>&nbsp;命令，添加以下四条：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">30 22 * * * php /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat SendDiaryMail\n0 0 * * * php -n /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat Job DailyJob\n*/1 * * * * php /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat Job CheckJob</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果需要自动备份，可模仿以下两例，自行添加一条。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>每 20 分钟备份 1 次（若间隔大于 60 分钟看下个例子）：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">*/20 * * * * php -n /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat Backup simple</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>每 20 小时备份 1 次（若间隔大于 24 小时请学会熟练使用搜索引擎）：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">0 */20 * * * php -n /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat Backup simple</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果需要财务报表，可选添加以下三条：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">5 0 * * * php /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat FinanceMail day\n6 0 * * 0 php /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat FinanceMail week\n7 0 1 * * php /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat FinanceMail month</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果需要检测被墙，需要添加：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">*/1 * * * * php /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat DetectGFW</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果要用到 radius，需要添加下面这三条：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">*/1 * * * * php /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat SyncRadius synclogin\n*/1 * * * * php /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat SyncRadius syncvpn\n*/1 * * * * php -n /www/wwwroot/你的文件夹名/xcat SyncRadius syncnas</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>至此面板全部安装完成，又一个万人机场就此诞生。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>备注：如果依赖安装不上可以执行以下几句</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">rm -rf vendor\nrm -f composer.lock\ncomposer install</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->','sspanel-UIM','','publish','open','open','','sspanel-uim','','','2023-05-30 03:55:40','2023-05-29 19:55:40','',0,'https://HF.xn--i8s34n4wz.xyz/?p=617',0,'post','',0),(618,1,'2022-09-10 04:10:16','2022-09-09 20:10:16','{\"version\": 2, \"isGlobalStylesUserThemeJSON\": true }','Custom Styles','','publish','closed','closed','','wp-global-styles-hello-elementor','','','2022-09-10 04:10:16','2022-09-09 20:10:16','',0,'https://hfz.xn--i8s34n4wz.xyz/2022/09/10/wp-global-styles-hello-elementor/',0,'wp_global_styles','',0),(719,1,'2023-02-01 14:24:32','2023-02-01 06:24:32','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>我把我搭建的整个过程整理一下，步骤尽量精简，然后写下了这一篇文章，主要目的是想给大家分享下我的学习经验，让新手少走一点弯路，也能给自己增加点印象。所有的步骤（除了域名参数）我在写完之后都有重装系统然后全部重新走一遍验证一次。如果想提高一次成功的几率，建议使用全新安装的系统，然后严格按照我的步骤要求来做。如有错误，请及时留言提出，谢谢！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n<div data-type=\"payshow\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-hide-content\"><span>[hidecontent type=\"payshow\"]</span><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>一、前言</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>为什么要自己搭建邮件系统？</strong><br>• 自从小学上信息技术课接触到电子邮件开始，我就对 @ 后面那几个字母充满了疑惑，为什么 @ 后面的几个字母一定要是 qq 、gmail 呢？难道不能自定义吗？直到初三我弄懂了域名这个概念之后，这个谜团才被解开：我们用的是别人的服务器来使用电子邮件服务。自己有域名当然也可以搭建一个啊！由于当时还基本上没有云主机这种东西，而且家里也不让我整天开着电脑（电信有公网 IP ），所以该计划暂时搁置。直到 2015 年，用 163 邮箱的 Apple ID 大规模被盗（很庆幸我逃过了一劫），我这才明白了自己有个邮箱服务器那是多么重要！恰好高考完了，可以折腾一番了。当时用的是傻瓜式的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.apple.com/cn/macos/server/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">macOS Server</a>&nbsp;，啥原理都不懂，点几下就搭建成功了，就这样凑合着用了一年，系统非常稳定，除了停电以及升级系统之外没有重启过（这里赞一下&nbsp;<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.apple.com/cn/macos/server/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">macOS Server</a>&nbsp;）。<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.apple.com/cn/macos/server/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">macOS Server</a>&nbsp;最大的缺点就是可以自己定制的功能太少了！现在熟悉了 Linux 的基本操作和服务器的基础知识，是时候该在 Linux 平台上搭建一个了！<br>• 其实，Linux 上也有傻瓜式邮件系统，<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//www.iredmail.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">iRedMail</a>&nbsp;就是其中之一。不过我玩 Linux 的目的就是为了学习服务器以及网络知识，还是自己搭建一个才能学到东西。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>邮件系统所涉及的模块较多，而且软件又是不断更新的，不同 Linux 发行版的系统环境和默认配置文件也可能不相同，想只看一篇教程然后一次完美的几率太低了。我自己折腾了一个星期，中途也遇到过各种各样的错误，不过好在最后都解决了。所以说，想要自己亲手搭建一个完美的邮件系统，耐心是必不可少的。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>我把我搭建的整个过程整理一下，步骤尽量精简，然后写下了这一篇文章，主要目的是想给大家分享下我的学习经验，让新手少走一点弯路，也能给自己增加点印象。所有的步骤（除了域名参数）我在写完之后都有重装系统然后全部重新走一遍验证一次。如果想提高一次成功的几率，建议使用全新安装的系统，然后严格按照我的步骤要求来做。如有错误，请及时留言提出，谢谢！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>二、所需软件 &amp; 环境</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>操作系统：<strong>CentOS 7.3.1611 最小安装 （已关闭 SELinux 和防火墙）</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>应用软件：&nbsp;<strong>Postfix 2.10.1 、Dovecot 2.2.10 、MariaDB 5.5.52 、OpenDKIM 2.11.0 、Nginx 1.10.2 、PHP 5.4.16 、Roundcube WebMail 1.3.0</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>域名（主机名）：<strong><code>example.com</code></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>公网 IP：<strong><code>1.1.1.1</code></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>二级域名</strong>&nbsp;<strong><code>mail</code></strong>（这里就是&nbsp;<code>mail.example.com</code>）<strong>的数字证书</strong>（推荐免费的 Let’s Encrypt）</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>1、下文的 MySQL 均代表 MariaDB；<br>2、Nginx 和 PHP 不做详细配置，只确保 Webmail 可以正常使用。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>三、原理 &amp; 关系图</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>下面两张图足以说明一切：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-acb10dfff55bee4dea9280f3cd22be9a_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-92737a0050b1cb38f4191143cf153646_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• SMTP 是 Postfix 发件的模块，SMTPD 是 Postfix 收件的模块，请注意区分。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>四、安装软件</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">yum -y update &amp;&amp; \\\nyum -y install epel-release &amp;&amp; \\\nyum -y update &amp;&amp; \\\nyum -y install dovecot dovecot-mysql mariadb-server nginx opendkim php-fpm php-mbstring php-mysql php-xml postfix pypolicyd-spf tar wget</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>若出现密钥警告，按&nbsp;<code>y</code>&nbsp;回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>五、配置 MySQL</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.1 初始化 MySQL</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.1.1 启动服务</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.1.2 进行安全设置</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">mysql_secure_installation </code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后根据提示操作：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">NOTE: RUNNING ALL PARTS OF THIS SCRIPT IS RECOMMENDED FOR ALL MySQL\n      SERVERS IN PRODUCTION USE!  PLEASE READ EACH STEP CAREFULLY!\n\nIn order to log into MySQL to secure it, we\'ll need the current\npassword for the root user.  If you\'ve just installed MySQL, and\nyou haven\'t set the root password yet, the password will be blank,\nso you should just press enter here.\n\nEnter current password for root (enter for none): # 回车即可\nOK, successfully used password, moving on...\n\nSetting the root password ensures that nobody can log into the MySQL\nroot user without the proper authorisation.\n\nSet root password? [Y/n] y # 使用密码验证\nNew password: # 设置 root 密码\nRe-enter new password: \nPassword updated successfully!\nReloading privilege tables..\n ... Success!\n\n# 后面的问题全部按 y 回车，这里省略。</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.2 邮件系统数据库的创建</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>注意</strong><br>• SQL 语句后面要加上分号才能执行。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.2.1 进入 MySQL 命令行界面</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后输入刚才设置的数据库 Root 密码然后按回车。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>出现&nbsp;<code>MariaDB [(none)]&gt;</code>&nbsp;指示符就说明进入了。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.2.2 创建一个用户用于读取邮件系统数据库</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">CREATE USER \'mail_sys\'@\'localhost\' IDENTIFIED BY \'mail_sys\';</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.2.3 创建邮件系统数据库</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">CREATE DATABASE mail_sys;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 这里的“邮件系统数据库”并不存储邮件，只用作域名、用户、别名的验证。邮件默认是存储在&nbsp;<code>/var/spool/mail</code>&nbsp;里面的。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.2.4 为用户授予读取权限</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">GRANT SELECT ON mail_sys.* TO \'mail_sys\'@\'localhost\' IDENTIFIED BY \'mail_sys\';</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.2.5 刷新权限</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.2.6 进入邮件系统数据库</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.2.7 创建域名表</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">CREATE TABLE `domains` ( `id` int(20) NOT NULL auto_increment, `name` varchar(100) NOT NULL, PRIMARY KEY (`id`) ) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.2.8 创建用户表</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">CREATE TABLE `users` ( `id` int(20) NOT NULL auto_increment, `domain_id` int(20) NOT NULL, `password` varchar(200) NOT NULL, `email` varchar(200) NOT NULL, PRIMARY KEY (`id`), UNIQUE KEY `email` (`email`), FOREIGN KEY (domain_id) REFERENCES domains(id) ON DELETE CASCADE ) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.2.9 创建别名表</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">CREATE TABLE `aliases` ( `id` int(20) NOT NULL auto_increment, `domain_id` int(20) NOT NULL, `source` varchar(200) NOT NULL, `destination` varchar(200) NOT NULL, PRIMARY KEY (`id`), FOREIGN KEY (domain_id) REFERENCES domains(id) ON DELETE CASCADE ) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.3 往邮件系统数据库里添加或删除域名、用户、别名</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>1、为了方便以后添加或删除，下面我把 SQL 语句（命令）的格式写出来；<br>2、索引号从 1 开始依次递增，需手动指定；<br>3、由于密码需要使用 SQL 语句进行 SHA512 运算来存储散列值，因此图形化数据库管理工具可能无法实现；<br>4、当添加多行数据时，非末行的行分隔符为逗号，直到末行才使用分号。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.3.1 添加或删除域名</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>添加域名</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">INSERT INTO `mail_sys`.`domains` (`id` ,`name`) \nVALUES (\'&lt;域名索引号>\', \'&lt;域名>\');</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>例如：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">MariaDB [mail_sys]> INSERT INTO `mail_sys`.`domains` (`id` ,`name`) \n    -> VALUES (\'1\', \'example.com\');</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>删除域名</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">DELETE FROM `mail_sys`.`domains` WHERE `id`=\'&lt;域名索引号>\';</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.3.2 添加或删除用户</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>添加用户</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">INSERT INTO `mail_sys`.`users`\n(`id`, `domain_id`, `password` , `email`) VALUES\n(\'&lt;用户索引号>\', \'&lt;域名索引号>\', ENCRYPT(\'&lt;密码>\', CONCAT(\'$6$\', SUBSTRING(SHA(RAND()), -16))), \'&lt;邮箱地址>\'),\n(\'&lt;用户索引号>\', \'&lt;域名索引号>\', ENCRYPT(\'&lt;密码>\', CONCAT(\'$6$\', SUBSTRING(SHA(RAND()), -16))), \'&lt;邮箱地址>\'),\n(\'&lt;用户索引号>\', \'&lt;域名索引号>\', ENCRYPT(\'&lt;密码>\', CONCAT(\'$6$\', SUBSTRING(SHA(RAND()), -16))), \'&lt;邮箱地址>\');</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>例如：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">MariaDB [mail_sys]> INSERT INTO `mail_sys`.`users`\n    -> (`id`, `domain_id`, `password` , `email`) VALUES\n    -> (\'1\', \'1\', ENCRYPT(\'12345678\', CONCAT(\'$6$\', SUBSTRING(SHA(RAND()), -16))), \'user1@example.com\'),\n    -> (\'2\', \'1\', ENCRYPT(\'password\', CONCAT(\'$6$\', SUBSTRING(SHA(RAND()), -16))), \'user2@example.com\'),\n    -> (\'3\', \'1\', ENCRYPT(\'11111111\', CONCAT(\'$6$\', SUBSTRING(SHA(RAND()), -16))), \'user3@example.com\');\n#以后再继续添加用户名的时候，用户索引就应该从4开始，下同。</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>删除用户</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">DELETE FROM `mail_sys`.`users` WHERE `id`=\'&lt;用户索引号>\';</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.3.3 添加或删除别名（可选）</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 别名的意思就比如说：设置&nbsp;<code>user1@example.com</code>&nbsp;的别名是&nbsp;<code>user11@example.com</code>&nbsp;，那么其他人往&nbsp;<code>user11@example.com</code>&nbsp;里发送邮件时，邮件就会到&nbsp;<code>user1@example.com</code>&nbsp;的邮箱里去。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>添加别名</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">INSERT INTO `mail_sys`.`aliases`\n(`id`, `domain_id`, `source`, `destination`) VALUES\n(\'&lt;别名索引号>\', \'&lt;域名索引号>\', \'&lt;别名地址>\', \'&lt;目的地址>\'),\n(\'&lt;别名索引号>\', \'&lt;域名索引号>\', \'&lt;别名地址>\', \'&lt;目的地址>\'),\n(\'&lt;别名索引号>\', \'&lt;域名索引号>\', \'&lt;别名地址>\', \'&lt;目的地址>\');</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>例如：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">MariaDB [mail_sys]> INSERT INTO `mail_sys`.`aliases`\n    -> (`id`, `domain_id`, `source`, `destination`) VALUES\n    -> (\'1\', \'1\', \'user11@example.com\', \'user1@example.com\'),\n    -> (\'2\', \'1\', \'user22@example.com\', \'user2@example.com\'),\n    -> (\'3\', \'1\', \'user33@example.com\', \'user3@example.com\');</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>删除别名</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">DELETE FROM `mail_sys`.`aliases` WHERE `id`=\'&lt;别名索引号>\';</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.4 检查数据库</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.4.1 检查域名表</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">SELECT * FROM mail_sys.domains;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>若出现以下格式的输出结果，说明设置正确。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">+----+-------------+\n| id | name        |\n+----+-------------+\n|  1 | example.com |\n+----+-------------+\n1 row in set (0.00 sec)</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.4.2 检查用户表</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">SELECT * FROM mail_sys.users;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>若出现以下格式的输出结果，说明设置正确。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">+----+-----------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------+\n| id | domain_id | password                                                                                                   | email             |\n+----+-----------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------+\n|  1 |         1 | $6$afbdd821f68a3f27$QH9yDKslGZMNZjzvBBvMtYXzzclbnNgb1AhmB7lqu6fj6PU04QTgCTvcvPwqsAaW6mJt9kcKPicN0VCQGalg5/ | user1@example.com |\n|  2 |         1 | $6$a4f819161bd19901$oeDntXEyiY6RiM369ugKZrMfsK6yeV3CG/fhFF4ruPJImLCyzi2hR/PX8f2nBDBRWiMvWv7zWiNv5yEruRsW// | user2@example.com |\n|  3 |         1 | $6$2a85aaab0ec76f64$KRQ2H8Zgn0YjTzDDnfwqim3mZynZ05iPMZ1GQPw7GNuJApcXuLi5LOmR9yDC6Jh2eAKbhuG4lgHG.I5FdIrf4. | user3@example.com |\n+----+-----------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-------------------+\n3 rows in set (0.00 sec)</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>5.4.3 检查别名表（可选）</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">SELECT * FROM mail_sys.aliases;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>若出现以下格式的输出结果，说明设置正确。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">+----+-----------+--------------------+-------------------+\n| id | domain_id | source             | destination       |\n+----+-----------+--------------------+-------------------+\n|  1 |         1 | user11@example.com | user1@example.com |\n|  2 |         1 | user22@example.com | user2@example.com |\n|  3 |         1 | user33@example.com | user3@example.com |\n+----+-----------+--------------------+-------------------+\n3 rows in set (0.00 sec)</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>数据库设置完成。按&nbsp;<code>Ctrl + D</code>&nbsp;退出 MySQL 命令行界面。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>六、设置邮件系统专用用户</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>1、所有的邮件用户都映射到系统的同一个真实的用户上；<br>2、不建议直接使用系统自带的&nbsp;<code>mail</code>&nbsp;账户。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>6.1 创建邮件系统专用组</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">groupadd -g 2000 mail_sys</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>6.2 创建邮件系统专用用户</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">useradd -g mail_sys -u 2000 mail_sys -d /var/spool/mail -s /sbin/nologin</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>6.3 修改邮件目录所有者</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">chown -R mail_sys:mail_sys /var/spool/mail</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>七、配置 Postfix</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.1 备份原版配置文件</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cp -r /etc/postfix /etc/postfix.bak</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.2 修改 main.cf</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 该文件配置 Postfix 的全局参数。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/postfix/main.cf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>请按实际情况以及注释提示<strong>修改以下内容</strong>，完成后去除&nbsp;<code>#</code>&nbsp;号和后面的注释，然后粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">mydomain = example.com # 您的域名，需要修改\nmyhostname = mail.example.com # 您的域名前面加上 mail. 需要修改\nmydestination = localhost\nalias_maps = hash:/etc/aliases\nalias_database = hash:/etc/aliases\nmyorigin = /etc/mailname\nmynetworks = 127.0.0.0/8\nmailbox_size_limit = 0\nrecipient_delimiter = +\ninet_protocols = all\ninet_interfaces = all\nsmtp_address_preference = ipv4\nsmtpd_banner = ESMTP\nbiff = no\nappend_dot_mydomain = no\nreadme_directory = no\nvirtual_transport = lmtp:unix:private/dovecot-lmtp\nsmtpd_sasl_type = dovecot\nsmtpd_sasl_path = private/auth\nsmtpd_sasl_auth_enable = yes\nvirtual_mailbox_domains = mysql:/etc/postfix/mysql_mailbox_domains.cf\nvirtual_mailbox_maps = mysql:/etc/postfix/mysql_mailbox_maps.cf\nvirtual_alias_maps = mysql:/etc/postfix/mysql_alias_maps.cf\nsmtpd_sender_login_maps = mysql:/etc/postfix/mysql_mailbox_maps.cf, mysql:/etc/postfix/mysql_alias_maps.cf\ndisable_vrfy_command = yes\nstrict_rfc821_envelopes = yes\nsmtpd_sender_restrictions = reject_non_fqdn_sender, reject_unknown_sender_domain, reject_sender_login_mismatch\nsmtpd_recipient_restrictions = reject_non_fqdn_recipient, reject_unknown_recipient_domain, permit_sasl_authenticated, reject_unauth_destination, check_policy_service unix:private/policyd-spf\nvirtual_uid_maps = static:2000\nvirtual_gid_maps = static:2000\nmessage_size_limit = 102400000\nsmtpd_tls_security_level = may\nsmtp_tls_security_level = may\nsmtpd_tls_cert_file=/etc/pki/tls/certs/cert.pem # mail.example.com 证书文件位置，需要修改\nsmtpd_tls_key_file=/etc/pki/tls/private/key.pem # mail.example.com 证书私钥文件位置，需要修改\nsmtpd_tls_session_cache_database = btree:\\${data_directory}/smtpd_scache\nsmtp_tls_session_cache_database = btree:\\${data_directory}/smtp_scache\nsmtpd_tls_protocols = TLSv1.2, TLSv1.1, !TLSv1, !SSLv2, !SSLv3\nsmtp_tls_protocols = TLSv1.2, TLSv1.1, !TLSv1, !SSLv2, !SSLv3\nsmtp_tls_ciphers = high\nsmtpd_tls_ciphers = high\nsmtpd_tls_mandatory_protocols = TLSv1.2, TLSv1.1, !TLSv1, !SSLv2, !SSLv3\nsmtp_tls_mandatory_protocols = TLSv1.2, TLSv1.1, !TLSv1, !SSLv2, !SSLv3\nsmtp_tls_mandatory_ciphers = high\nsmtpd_tls_mandatory_ciphers = high\nsmtpd_tls_mandatory_exclude_ciphers = MD5, DES, ADH, RC4, PSD, SRP, 3DES, eNULL, aNULL\nsmtpd_tls_exclude_ciphers = MD5, DES, ADH, RC4, PSD, SRP, 3DES, eNULL, aNULL\nsmtp_tls_mandatory_exclude_ciphers = MD5, DES, ADH, RC4, PSD, SRP, 3DES, eNULL, aNULL\nsmtp_tls_exclude_ciphers = MD5, DES, ADH, RC4, PSD, SRP, 3DES, eNULL, aNULL\ntls_preempt_cipherlist = yes\nsmtpd_tls_received_header = yes\npolicyd-spf_time_limit = 3600\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.3 修改 master.cf</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 该文件配置 Postfix 中各模块的参数。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/postfix/master.cf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">smtp      inet  n       -       n       -       -       smtpd\nsubmission inet n       -       n       -       -       smtpd\n       -o smtpd_tls_security_level=encrypt\nsmtps     inet  n       -       n       -       -       smtpd\n       -o smtpd_tls_wrappermode=yes\npickup    unix  n       -       n       60      1       pickup\ncleanup   unix  n       -       n       -       0       cleanup\nqmgr      unix  n       -       n       300     1       qmgr\ntlsmgr    unix  -       -       n       1000?   1       tlsmgr\nrewrite   unix  -       -       n       -       -       trivial-rewrite\nbounce    unix  -       -       n       -       0       bounce\ndefer     unix  -       -       n       -       0       bounce\ntrace     unix  -       -       n       -       0       bounce\nverify    unix  -       -       n       -       1       verify\nflush     unix  n       -       n       1000?   0       flush\nproxymap  unix  -       -       n       -       -       proxymap\nproxywrite unix -       -       n       -       1       proxymap\nsmtp      unix  -       -       n       -       -       smtp\nrelay     unix  -       -       n       -       -       smtp\n       -o smtp_helo_timeout=120 -o smtp_connect_timeout=120\nshowq     unix  n       -       n       -       -       showq\nerror     unix  -       -       n       -       -       error\nretry     unix  -       -       n       -       -       error\ndiscard   unix  -       -       n       -       -       discard\nlocal     unix  -       n       n       -       -       local\nvirtual   unix  -       n       n       -       -       virtual\nlmtp      unix  -       -       n       -       -       lmtp\nanvil     unix  -       -       n       -       1       anvil\nscache    unix  -       -       n       -       1       scache\npolicyd-spf    unix  -       n       n       -       0       spawn\n       user=mail_sys argv=/usr/libexec/postfix/policyd-spf\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.4 与 MySQL 对接</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.4.1 指定域名数据表</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/postfix/mysql_mailbox_domains.cf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">user = mail_sys\npassword = mail_sys\nhosts = localhost\ndbname = mail_sys\nquery = SELECT 1 FROM domains WHERE name=\'%s\'\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.4.2 指定用户数据表</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/postfix/mysql_mailbox_maps.cf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">user = mail_sys\npassword = mail_sys\nhosts = localhost\ndbname = mail_sys\nquery = SELECT email FROM users WHERE email=\'%s\'\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.4.3 指定别名数据表</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/postfix/mysql_alias_maps.cf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">user = mail_sys\npassword = mail_sys\nhosts = localhost\ndbname = mail_sys\nquery = SELECT destination FROM aliases WHERE source=\'%s\'\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.5 测试数据库读取</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.5.1 启动 Postfix 服务</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.5.2 测试域名数据表的读取</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>下面的&nbsp;<code>example.com</code>&nbsp;请替换为自己设定的域名。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">postmap -q example.com mysql:/etc/postfix/mysql_mailbox_domains.cf</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>若返回&nbsp;<code>1</code>，则说明设置正确。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.5.3 测试用户数据表的读取</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>下面的&nbsp;<code>user2@example.com</code>&nbsp;请替换为自己设定的用户名的其中一个。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">postmap -q user2@example.com mysql:/etc/postfix/mysql_mailbox_maps.cf</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>若返回用户名，则说明设置正确。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.5.4 测试别名数据表的读取（可选）</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>下面的&nbsp;<code>user11@example.com</code>&nbsp;请替换为自己设定的别名其中一个。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">postmap -q user11@example.com mysql:/etc/postfix/mysql_alias_maps.cf</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>若返回别名所对应的真实用户名，则说明设置正确。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>7.5.5 停止 Postfix 服务</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>等全部配置完成后再启动。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>八、配置 Dovecot</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>8.1 备份原版配置文件</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cp -r /etc/dovecot /etc/dovecot.bak</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>8.2 修改 dovecot.conf</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 该文件配置 Dovecot 的全局参数。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/dovecot/dovecot.conf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">protocols = imap lmtp\ndict {\n}\n!include conf.d/*.conf\n!include_try local.conf\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>8.3 修改 conf.d/10-mail.conf</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 该文件配置邮箱文件存储的位置和命名空间。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/dovecot/conf.d/10-mail.conf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">namespace inbox {\n  inbox = yes\n}\nfirst_valid_uid = 1000\nmbox_write_locks = fcntl\nmail_location = maildir:/var/spool/mail/%d/%n\nmail_privileged_group = mail\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>8.4 修改 conf.d/15-mailboxes.conf</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 该文件配置邮箱内部的目录结构。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/dovecot/conf.d/15-mailboxes.conf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">namespace inbox {\n  mailbox Drafts {\n    auto = create\n    special_use = \\Drafts\n  }\n  mailbox Trash {\n    auto = create\n    special_use = \\Trash\n  }\n  mailbox Sent {\n    auto = create\n    special_use = \\Sent\n  }\n}\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>8.5 修改 conf.d/10-auth.conf</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 该文件配置用户身份认证流程。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/dovecot/conf.d/10-auth.conf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">auth_mechanisms = plain login\n!include auth-sql.conf.ext\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>8.6 修改 conf.d/auth-sql.conf.ext</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 该文件配置数据库认证的参数。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/dovecot/conf.d/auth-sql.conf.ext &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">passdb {\n  driver = sql\n  args = /etc/dovecot/dovecot-sql.conf.ext\n}\nuserdb {\n  driver = static\n  args = uid=mail_sys gid=mail_sys home=/var/spool/mail/%d/%n\n}\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>8.7 修改 dovecot-sql.conf.ext</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 该文件配置验证用户名密码所用的数据表以及认证方法。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/dovecot/dovecot-sql.conf.ext &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">driver = mysql\nconnect = host=localhost dbname=mail_sys user=mail_sys password=mail_sys\ndefault_pass_scheme = SHA512-CRYPT\npassword_query = SELECT email as user, password FROM users WHERE email=\'%u\';\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>8.8 修改 conf.d/10-ssl.conf</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 该文件配置 SSL 加密参数。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/dovecot/conf.d/10-ssl.conf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>请按实际情况以及注释提示<strong>修改以下内容</strong>，完成后去除&nbsp;<code>#</code>&nbsp;号和后面的注释，然后粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">ssl = required\nssl_cert = &lt;/etc/pki/tls/certs/cert.pem # mail.example.com 证书文件位置，需要修改\nssl_key = &lt;/etc/pki/tls/private/key.pem # mail.example.com 证书私钥文件位置，需要修改\nssl_protocols = TLSv1.2 TLSv1.1 !TLSv1 !SSLv2 !SSLv3\nssl_cipher_list = ALL:!MD5:!DES:!ADH:!RC4:!PSD:!SRP:!3DES:!eNULL:!aNULL\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>8.9 修改 conf.d/10-master.conf</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>• 该文件配置 Dovecot 中各服务的主要参数。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/dovecot/conf.d/10-master.conf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">service imap-login {\n  inet_listener imap {\n    port = 143\n  }\n  inet_listener imaps {\n    port = 993\n    ssl = yes\n  }\n}\n\nservice lmtp {\n    unix_listener /var/spool/postfix/private/dovecot-lmtp {\n    mode = 0600\n    user = postfix\n    group = postfix\n  }\n}\n\nservice imap {\n\n}\n\nservice auth {\n  unix_listener /var/spool/postfix/private/auth {\n    mode = 0666\n    user = postfix\n    group = postfix\n  }\n\n  unix_listener auth-userdb {\n    mode = 0600\n    user = mail_sys\n  }\n  user = dovecot\n}\n\nservice auth-worker {\n  user = mail_sys\n}\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>8.10 修改 conf.d/15-lda.conf</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>说明</strong><br>1、该文件配置特定域的 postmaster 邮箱；<br>2、我自己没有修改这个配置文件。但是根据部分网友反馈，如果不设定 postmaster 邮箱的话会导致收不到邮件，所以还是加上去吧。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/dovecot/conf.d/15-lda.conf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">postmaster_address = postmaster@%d\n\nprotocol lda {\n}\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>九、配置 OpenDKIM</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>9.1 修改 OpenDKIM 配置文件</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat > /etc/opendkim.conf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>请按实际情况以及注释提示<strong>修改以下内容</strong>，完成后去除&nbsp;<code>#</code>&nbsp;号和后面的注释，然后粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">Syslog yes\nUMask 002\nOversignHeaders From\nSocket inet:8891@127.0.0.1\nDomain example.com # 您的域名，需要修改\nKeyFile /etc/opendkim/keys/mail.private\nSelector mail\nRequireSafeKeys no\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>9.2 生成私钥</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>下面的&nbsp;<code>example.com</code>&nbsp;请替换成您的域名。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">opendkim-genkey -D /etc/opendkim/keys/ -d example.com -s mail &amp;&amp; \\\nchown -R opendkim:opendkim /etc/opendkim/keys/</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>9.3 配置 Postfix 的 main.cf</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>配置发件增加 DKIM 签名。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat >> /etc/postfix/main.cf &lt;&lt; EOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中按回车即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">milter_protocol = 2\nmilter_default_action = accept\nsmtpd_milters = inet:127.0.0.1:8891\nnon_smtpd_milters = inet:127.0.0.1:8891\nEOF</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>9.4 启动所有服务</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">systemctl start postfix dovecot opendkim</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需开机启动，请执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">systemctl enable postfix dovecot opendkim mariadb</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>十、配置域名记录</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下项目需要在域名服务商或云主机服务商的控制面板中设置。下文的域名服务商以 DNSPOD 为例，其他域名服务商或云主机服务商请自行参阅相关说明文档。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>10.1 A 记录的设定</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>在域名控制面板中添加一条记录，<strong>主机记录</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>@</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录类型</strong>选&nbsp;<strong><code>A</code></strong>&nbsp;<strong>记录值</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>1.1.1.1</code></strong>&nbsp;，其他保持默认，保存即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>10.2 MX 记录的设定</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>在域名控制面板中添加一条记录，<strong>主机记录</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>@</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录类型</strong>选&nbsp;<strong><code>MX</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录值</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>mail.example.com</code></strong>，其他保持默认；<br>再添加一条记录，<strong>主机记录</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>mail</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录类型</strong>选&nbsp;<strong><code>A</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录值</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>1.1.1.1</code></strong>，其他保持默认，保存即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>10.3 SPF 记录的设定</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>在域名控制面板中添加一条记录，<strong>主机记录</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>@</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录类型</strong>选&nbsp;<strong><code>TXT</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录值</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>v=spf1 mx -all</code></strong>，其他保持默认，保存即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>10.4 DMARC 记录的设定</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>在域名控制面板中添加一条记录，<strong>主机记录</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>_dmarc</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录类型</strong>选&nbsp;<strong><code>TXT</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录值</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>v=DMARC1; p=reject</code></strong>，其他保持默认，保存即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>10.5 DKIM 记录的设定</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>（以我的密钥文件为例）</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cat /etc/opendkim/keys/mail.txt </code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>会出现以下结果：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">mail._domainkey IN  TXT ( \"v=DKIM1; k=rsa; \"\n      \"p=MIGfMA0GCSqGSIb3DQEBAQUAA4GNADCBiQKBgQDU5nkxbS36hOa2FCJqotvahTbxb83CvLt5XqV4WAPzJQmfaA1eHyvOz9XiZgE8vWRgP2jJFlL+J4yEroB3YV/8EBjAM8lFTi31DVgRsoHMwH6f3GuLAfcuVofymDfRxHxPzIlm7rgzfWwrGcPrIzt64NLuZG4yusTWp8MTfWZxvQIDAQAB\" )  ; ----- DKIM key default for example.com</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>把括号内的值复制出来，去掉所有引号并整理成一行，形如：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">v=DKIM1; k=rsa; p=MIGfMA0GCSqGSIb3DQEBAQUAA4GNADCBiQKBgQDU5nkxbS36hOa2FCJqotvahTbxb83CvLt5XqV4WAPzJQmfaA1eHyvOz9XiZgE8vWRgP2jJFlL+J4yEroB3YV/8EBjAM8lFTi31DVgRsoHMwH6f3GuLAfcuVofymDfRxHxPzIlm7rgzfWwrGcPrIzt64NLuZG4yusTWp8MTfWZxvQIDAQAB</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>在域名控制面板中添加一条记录，<strong>主机记录</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>mail._domainkey</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录类型</strong>选&nbsp;<strong><code>TXT</code></strong>&nbsp;,<strong>记录值</strong>填&nbsp;<strong><code>v=DKIM1; k=rsa; p=MIGfMA0GCSqGSIb3DQEBAQUAA4GNADCBiQKBgQDU5nkxbS36hOa2FCJqotvahTbxb83CvLt5XqV4WAPzJQmfaA1eHyvOz9XiZgE8vWRgP2jJFlL+J4yEroB3YV/8EBjAM8lFTi31DVgRsoHMwH6f3GuLAfcuVofymDfRxHxPzIlm7rgzfWwrGcPrIzt64NLuZG4yusTWp8MTfWZxvQIDAQAB</code></strong>&nbsp;，其他保持默认，保存即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>上述五个步骤完成后域名控制面板的效果如下图：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-f16aa09ac54a649832d84a83bf65df95_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>10.6 IP 反向解析</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>这个……普通家庭宽带用户就别想了，企业宽带和国内云主机用户需要网站通过备案才能设置。如果用国外云主机的话，有些可以支持（我使用的 Vultr 支持）。将服务器的 IP 地址反向解析（PTR 记录）到 MX 域名（这里就是&nbsp;<code>mail.example.com</code>）可以大幅降低外发邮件被拒收的几率。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>十一、配置 Web 邮箱</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.1 下载并安装 Roundcube</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.1.1 下载</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">wget https://github.com/roundcube/roundcubemail/releases/download/1.3.0/roundcubemail-1.3.0-complete.tar.gz</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.1.2 解压 &amp; 安装</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">tar -xf roundcubemail-1.3.0-complete.tar.gz &amp;&amp; \\\nmv roundcubemail-1.3.0 /usr/share/roundcube &amp;&amp; \\\nchown -R apache:apache /usr/share/roundcube</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.2 配置 Nginx 、PHP</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.2.1 配置 Nginx</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">vi /etc/nginx/conf.d/mail.conf</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>请按实际情况以及注释提示<strong>修改以下内容</strong>，在命令行窗口按下&nbsp;<code>i</code>&nbsp;，将内容直接粘贴到命令行窗口中，再按下&nbsp;<code>ESC</code>&nbsp;，最后输入&nbsp;<code>:wq</code>&nbsp;按回车。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">server {\n    listen       80;\n    server_name  mail.example.com; # 您的域名前面加上 mail. 需要修改\n    return 301 https://$server_name$request_uri;\n}\n\nserver {\n    listen       443 ssl http2;\n    server_name  mail.example.com; # 您的域名前面加上 mail. 需要修改\n    ssl_certificate \"/etc/pki/tls/certs/cert.pem\"; # mail.example.com 证书文件位置，需要修改\n    ssl_certificate_key \"/etc/pki/tls/private/key.pem\"; # mail.example.com 证书私钥文件位置，需要修改\n    add_header Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=15552000; includeSubDomains\";\n    location / {\n     root         /usr/share/roundcube;\n     index        index.php;     \n    }   \n    location ~ .php$ {\n        root         /usr/share/roundcube;\n        fastcgi_pass   127.0.0.1:9000;\n        fastcgi_index  index.php;\n        fastcgi_param  SCRIPT_FILENAME  $document_root$fastcgi_script_name;\n        include        fastcgi_params;\n    }\n}</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.2.2 配置 PHP</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>设置时区</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">echo \"date.timezone = Asia/Shanghai\" >> /etc/php.ini </code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>创建会话文件夹</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">mkdir /var/lib/php/session &amp;&amp; \\\nchown apache:apache /var/lib/php/session</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.3 配置数据库</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.3.1 进入 MySQL 命令行界面</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后输入 5.1.2 设置的数据库 Root 密码然后按回车。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>出现&nbsp;<code>MariaDB [(none)]&gt;</code>&nbsp;指示符就说明进入了。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.3.2 创建一个用户用于读写 Roundcube 数据库</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">CREATE USER \'roundcube\'@\'localhost\' IDENTIFIED BY \'roundcube\';</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.3.3 创建 Roundcube 数据库</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">CREATE DATABASE roundcube;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.3.4 为用户授予读写权限</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">GRANT ALL ON roundcube.* TO \'roundcube\'@\'localhost\' IDENTIFIED BY \'roundcube\';</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.3.5 刷新权限</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下 SQL 语句：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>数据库设置完成。按&nbsp;<code>Ctrl + D</code>&nbsp;退出 MySQL 命令行界面。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.4 启动服务</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">systemctl start nginx php-fpm</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需开机启动，请执行以下命令：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">systemctl enable nginx php-fpm</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.5 配置 Roundcube</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>打开浏览器，输入&nbsp;<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//mail.example.com/installer/%3F_step%3D1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://mail.example.com/installer/?_step=1</a>&nbsp;，回车打开。然后按图片提示进行配置。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-de3ae4e8fde015b22edfc748357c9d78_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-49d621d07d7c1f377ae5b36be00a9b29_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-1c1f0553529e22c5e3204e648dca923c_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-05f1c681845375f502c15939079f2ba4_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e004a440128fa5e6ba3c9e33c9b3d086_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-5b9969c38a7b44cbf4c8f232e8ecc5ff_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-d00308aef4eecba9051aae0a3e21f825_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>配置完成后，关闭浏览器页面。执行以下命令来使安装程序不可用：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">chmod -R 000 /usr/share/roundcube/installer/</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>11.6 登录</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>打开浏览器，输入&nbsp;<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//mail.example.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://mail.example.com</a>&nbsp;，然后输入您的用户名密码登录。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f04d1ae52ddbddac2ef680401963f944_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>登录之后，默认只会有一个收件箱，我们再设置一下就完美了！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3ded68e7945dbc9a0e67820f2929ac20_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-fdde84f33a17ee9e5abbf813678c603c_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>最终效果如下图：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-376035aebfb9bb3ddcfbb2ed65558cfc_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>十二、收发件测试</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>12.1 收件测试</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>非常简单，从 QQ 或者 Gmail 给自己的邮箱发一封邮件，如果可以收到，说明外网已经可以连通这台服务器了。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>12.2 发件测试</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>打开浏览器，输入&nbsp;<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.mail-tester.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://www.mail-tester.com</a>&nbsp;，回车打开。发一封邮件到它指定的邮箱里。然后过一分钟左右查看下结果，重点检查&nbsp;<strong>SPF 记录</strong>、<strong>DMARC 记录</strong>和&nbsp;<strong>DKIM 签名</strong>是不是有效的。如果都是有效的，那恭喜您！您的邮件系统已经搭建完了！至于这个得分，由于受 IP 地址可能被拉黑的影响，因此各人的分数有可能不同。如果有 8 分以上的话发出去的邮件基本上就不会被拒收了。如果很不幸 IP 地址被拉黑了，建议换一个 IP 地址。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-46ef27d52458f679d32ca5dfd12d6080_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>十三、防火墙的设置（可选）</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果服务器需要部署防火墙，请放行&nbsp;<code>TCP 25</code>、<code>TCP 465</code>、<code>TCP 587</code>&nbsp;以及&nbsp;<code>TCP 993</code>这四个端口的传入链接。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以 iptables 为例，配置命令为：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">iptables -A INPUT -p tcp -m multiport --dports 25,465,587,993 -j ACCEPT</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后根据需要自行保存防火墙的配置。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>十四、不完美的地方 &amp; 总结</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>之所以标题上的完美打了个双引号，原因之一是本来我计划配置垃圾邮件过滤功能的，但是不知道是不是我设置错误还是网络问题，很多非垃圾邮件都被拒收了，在网上搜索了两天还是无解，所以暂时放弃。（PS ：几个月前我用过一次&nbsp;<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//www.iredmail.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">iRedMail</a>&nbsp;，里面的垃圾邮件过滤模块也同样导致很多非垃圾邮件被拒收，所以我感觉网络问题大一些。）</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>此外，这个邮件系统并没有实现使用 Web 界面管理邮件系统（如增减用户）的功能，由于我搭建的邮件系统只有我一个人在用，所以也就不折腾啦。</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>最后非常感谢能够耐心读完这篇文章的人，希望您有所收获！</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>十五、参考文献</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.linode.com/docs/email/postfix/email-with-postfix-dovecot-and-mysql\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Email with Postfix, Dovecot, and MySQL</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.digitalocean.com/community/tutorials/how-to-configure-a-mail-server-using-postfix-dovecot-mysql-and-spamassassin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How To Configure a Mail Server Using Postfix, Dovecot, MySQL, and SpamAssassin</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//www.open-open.com/lib/view/open1431592348122.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Postfix + Dovecot + MySQL 搭建邮件服务器</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//blog.tiger-workshop.com/ubuntu-postfix-mail-server-mta-outgoing-spf-dkim-rdns-dmarc/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ubuntu Postfix Mail Server 設定筆記 (一) MTA (SPF, DKIM, rDNS 及 DMARC)</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.linuxdashen.com/debian-8-server%25E6%2590%25AD%25E5%25BB%25BApostfixdovecot%25E9%2582%25AE%25E4%25BB%25B6%25E6%259C%258D%25E5%258A%25A1%25E5%2599%25A8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Debian 8 Server 搭建 Postfix + Dovecot 邮件服务器</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//blog.kruyt.org/postfix-and-tls-encryption/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Postfix and TLS encryption</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//www.postfix.org/postconf.5.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Postfix Configuration Parameters</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/roundcube/roundcubemail/wiki/Installation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How to install Roundcube</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.howtoforge.com/running-roundcube-0.7.1-on-nginx-lemp-on-debian-squeeze-ubuntu-11.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Running Roundcube 0.7.1 On Nginx (LEMP) On Debian Squeeze/Ubuntu 11.10</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list --><span>[/hidecontent]</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->','企业域名邮箱系统｜Roundcube Webmail｜0基础搭建 从入门到精通','','publish','open','open','','%e4%bc%81%e4%b8%9a%e5%9f%9f%e5%90%8d%e9%82%ae%e7%ae%b1%e7%b3%bb%e7%bb%9f%ef%bd%9croundcube-webmail%ef%bd%9c0%e5%9f%ba%e7%a1%80%e6%90%ad%e5%bb%ba-%e4%bb%8e%e5%85%a5%e9%97%a8%e5%88%b0%e7%b2%be%e9%80%9a','','','2023-02-01 14:24:32','2023-02-01 06:24:32','',0,'https://hfz.pw/?p=719',0,'post','',0),(793,1,'2023-01-09 02:04:19','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','有锁iPhone/美版苹果是什么？值不值得购买？','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-01-09 02:04:19','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://hfz.pw/?p=793',0,'post','',0),(795,1,'2023-02-06 02:08:36','2023-02-05 18:08:36','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">介绍</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>现在个体工商户的营业执照非常的好办理，基本在线上就可以办理，大部分人开一些网上小店小店需要营业执照。给大家简单的介绍一下怎么办理营业执照。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>第一，要给自己的营业执照想一个名字，这个名字和以后开店的名字可以不一样不用太在意，营业执照上的名称是由行政区划+字号+行业特点+组织形式组成，最好多准备几个，比较容易出现重复的名义。只是卖一些百货，衣服，用品这些不用办理前置许可，如果需要经营食品，影响这些产品比较麻烦一些。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>第二，需要的资料，一张合法的身份证，手机号，需要用到委托的稍微麻烦一些，大部分不需要</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>第三，按流程办理，一般在当地的工商局，或者网上都可以办理出来，也非常的简单，审批很快，没有麻烦的流程。<br><br>注意事项：如果只是开店是不需要印章的，啥都不用领非常简单。营业执照出来以后一周后基本就可以在国家工商系统查到。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">本平台快速代办理</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>本平台快速办理、24小时内下证</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>正规合法代办理，必须本人</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>所需材料：本人身份证正反面</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>电话号码</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>快递收货地址</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":\"500px\",\"height\":\"500px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230503/20230503_1683051045.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:500px;height:500px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n<div data-type=\"payshow\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-hide-content\"><span>[hidecontent type=\"payshow\"]</span><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>购买完联系</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><span>[/hidecontent]</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n\n<!-- wp:more -->\n<!--more-->\n<!-- /wp:more -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"867\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"867\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"559\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"559\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->','企业营业执照如何申请办理？有什么用？','','publish','open','open','','%e4%bc%81%e4%b8%9a%e8%90%a5%e4%b8%9a%e6%89%a7%e7%85%a7%e5%a6%82%e4%bd%95%e7%94%b3%e8%af%b7%e5%8a%9e%e7%90%86%ef%bc%9f%e6%9c%89%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88%e7%94%a8%ef%bc%9f','','','2024-10-05 22:26:55','2024-10-05 14:26:55','',0,'https://hfz.pw/?p=795',0,'post','',0),(807,1,'2023-01-10 05:23:45','2023-01-09 21:23:45','<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230409/20230409_1680978178.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"126\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"126\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->','最新版zibi主题/子比主题-WordPress主题','','publish','open','open','','%e3%80%90wordpress%e4%b8%bb%e9%a2%98%e3%80%91-zibi%e4%b8%bb%e9%a2%98-%e5%ad%90%e6%af%94%e4%b8%bb%e9%a2%98v6-4-1%e5%85%8d%e6%8e%88%e6%9d%83','','','2024-09-15 15:42:26','2024-09-15 07:42:26','',0,'https://hfz.pw/?p=807',0,'post','',0),(822,1,'2023-02-01 22:00:16','2023-02-01 14:00:16','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>介绍说明</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1 插u盘，看ipad接口来选择。ipad里用 文件 这个软件来管理。用 文件 管理的文件，各种软件里都可以访问到。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2 电脑上用爱思助手之类，ipa用数据线连接电脑。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3 上传文件到网盘。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>IPA砸壳文件</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/buttons {\"quantity\":2} -->\n<div data-quantity=\"2\" data-radius=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-buttons radius\"><span class=\"an_1 but hollow c-green\"><a href=\"https://toyou.club/download?id=65\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://toyou.club/download?id=65\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">微信-8.0.29</a></span><span class=\"an_2 but hollow c-green\"><a href=\"https://toyou.club/download?id=63\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://toyou.club/download?id=63\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">微信-8.0.24</a></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>工具软件</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/buttons {\"quantity\":4} -->\n<div data-quantity=\"4\" data-radius=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-buttons radius\"><span class=\"an_1 but hollow c-blue\"><a href=\"https://toyou.club/download?id=58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ipa提取软件</a></span><span class=\"an_2 but hollow c-blue\"><a href=\"https://toyou.club/download?id=245\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://toyou.club/download?id=245\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WDBRemove（解除ipa限制）</a></span><span class=\"an_3 but hollow c-blue\"><a href=\"https://toyou.club/download?id=162\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://toyou.club/download?id=162\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">牛蛙助手</a></span><span class=\"an_4 but hollow c-blue\"><a href=\"https://dwvhsk.06dn.com/up/7410/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6/H5GG.deb\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://dwvhsk.06dn.com/up/7410/%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6/H5GG.deb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">H5GG</a></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"253\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"253\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->','iPa提取方式｜苹果/iPhone/iOS｜ipa软件破壳方式','','publish','open','open','','ipa%e6%8f%90%e5%8f%96%e6%96%b9%e5%bc%8f%ef%bd%9c%e8%8b%b9%e6%9e%9c-iphone-ios%ef%bd%9cipa%e8%bd%af%e4%bb%b6%e7%a0%b4%e5%a3%b3%e6%96%b9%e5%bc%8f','','','2023-02-01 22:00:16','2023-02-01 14:00:16','',0,'https://hfz.pw/?p=822',0,'post','',0),(831,1,'2023-02-03 00:43:54','2023-02-02 16:43:54','<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-450070ed62c683521fa63dd2342310f0_720w.jpg?source=172ae18b\" alt=\"2023有什么便宜好用的流量卡套餐推荐？（附流量套餐详解）\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>我敢肯定，知乎里所有测评和推荐流量卡套餐的博主，文章可以收获上万赞的，绝对不超五个。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>文章有上万赞同的同时，还坚持“<strong>所有的”流量卡优先自己激活测评</strong>，<strong>除了我你绝对找不到第二个！</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-1ed2d063c19295ac52d7f8a6ebd96419_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>又因为之前一些朋友，问我关于流量卡的小问题，我解答的很耐心，于是他们逢人便说所有关于流量卡的问题都可以找左右，所以——</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>我便因此成为了流量卡领域答疑解惑第一人，</strong>毫不客气的说，我给解决过问题的好友数量，甚至可能都比你们看过的文章数量还多。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>解决的问题多了以后才发现，有些问题真的不是测评一下就能搞懂的，所以——</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>我就又成了每个月花好几百块养着十多张流量卡的大冤种博主，</strong>下文所有的流量卡都是自己本人亲自测评并长期使用，绝对把各种套餐都给你讲的明明白白，让每个即想压缩月租成本，又想流量可以敞开用的知友都可以安心的入手！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果对你有帮助，那么千万记得<strong>双击屏幕，三连+关注。</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果想让左右测评文中没有的流量卡，记得评论区留言。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>一，流量卡推荐</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>其实这么多后台私信知友们问的最多的问题就是——“某个卡到底是不是正规卡？”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>直属运营商，一键申请，信息直接传输到运营商系统，1-3个工作日审批开卡，打包发货，足不出户，手指轻轻一点，一张崭新的手机卡就能发货到你的手里。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>激活全程都在运营商官网进行，激活后<strong>可直接登录运营商专属app</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>【中国移动】<br>【中国联通】<br>【电信电信】</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>后期充值话费，查询套餐，及注销卡号，也全部可以在<strong>官网进行</strong>。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>当然，<strong>线上优惠套餐除了这些优点就没有缺点么？</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>答案是：</strong>肯定有，月租话费一直涨，更新迭代特别快，好卡总是下架快。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>很多好卡每次只上架三五天甚至是几个小时就会下架！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>所以，<strong>遇见心动的那一款，别犹豫，直接入！</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>二，便宜好用的流量卡推荐</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>实时更新三大运营商便宜好用的流量卡，建议优先点个赞同，每次更新后都可获得实时推送！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>说找不到客服小卡片的伙伴们，在这里！</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>套餐办理/订单查询/客服售后，尽在公众号【好卡推荐助手】</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>客服处提供粉丝交流群，做为全站流量卡推荐头部博主，为各位对流量卡感兴趣的小伙伴提供开放交流场所！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-74b0d92cebea3077d352f0b79ecb3430_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>春节假期结束，大家填写<strong>收货地址记得填写为常住地址</strong>，不要因为回老家填写老家地址，人已返程而包裹姗姗来迟！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>同时也<strong>不要带着手机卡包裹进行远距离位移后再激活</strong>，运营商为了防止电信诈骗，防止二次买卖手机卡，会进行激活定位，如果激活时定位和所填写的收获地址相距较远，可能会导致无法激活，最好在收获地址一公里内进行激活！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>【流量和5G】</strong>运营商官方规则，激活后流量包以及5G权益包三个工作日内到账（非高峰时段基本上也就是几个小时）</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-255530affd6226bbdecdbccdd2b7d42f_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">需要注意的是，运营商从2019年年初开始就规定不可以因为异地设置不能销户这一规则，所以，如果有人给你说，需要到归属地才能够销户，举报他，不要客气，他在坑你！</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>-电信篇-</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>1.电信木棉卡（长期套餐）</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-acfc9268d2f5cbfd19156f68e5541e82_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>29月租每月100G高速不限速流量，包括70G全国通用流量+30G全国定向流量，套餐超出是5元/G，通话是0.1元/分钟；</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>长期套餐，无协议期，可自选号码，可自主激活，首月免费，激活后不主动变更套餐就一直是29月租100G，不想用了可以直接中国电信app一键销户；</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>于2021年7月就第一次上架的木棉卡在过去的一年多内所谓是<strong>有口皆碑，</strong>博主本人自己申请的木棉卡也是一直把他当作主力卡来使用，体验感一级棒！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>并且木棉卡是现在<strong>唯一一款</strong>29月租的情况下保持<strong>百G流量</strong>还可以实现<strong>自主选号</strong>和<strong>一次性20年优惠</strong>的一款流量卡，妥妥的性价比天花板！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>知友免费申请地址：</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>因为<strong>太过于优惠</strong>，所以木棉卡<strong>这次返场</strong>预计<strong>持续五天左右</strong>，2022年以来运营商限制低价套餐趋势日渐严重，如果再次下架那么大概率再无返场可能，所以这次千万<strong>不要再“等等”，可能错过即是永别</strong>；</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2023流量卡推荐——电信木棉卡29元100G自选号码长期套餐</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>不发货地区：</strong>新疆，西藏，云南，重庆，北京,及其他较少部分因为疫情无法派送地区，具体以运营商审核结果为准！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>实测截图反馈：</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-c8f6e47d55d41883607b0b56c3c8a0da_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>审核通过后电信运营商会将快递打包发出，包裹内附有<strong>电话卡一张+激活操作说明书一份</strong>，扫码操作即可：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>①</strong>.激活时自动跳转选号步骤，激活后首月免费使用，会赠送30元仅首月有效的体验金，只要套餐使用不超出，30元体验金可以抵消首月月租。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>②.</strong>激活后三个工作日内流量会全部到账（非高峰时段也就半个小时左右），且首月部分流量采用按天折算政策，所以首月到账流量会比100G稍微少一些。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>30G定向：首月剩余几天就到账几G&nbsp;<br>70G通用：全额到账</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>③</strong>.叠加的流量包都有减免，可以在中国电信app-查询办理-套餐-已订业务-我的优惠查询，也可以直接转电信人工客服查询，不会收取任何费用。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>④</strong>.激活时预存100话费一次性添加20年优惠，无需手动续费，保持正常使用就会一直有29元100G的优惠。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>⑤.</strong>随时可以销户，并且支持中国电信app线上一键销户。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>总结：</strong>对于需求点在用流量上，或者有给家里长辈或者小孩使用的需求，不想要有续费的麻烦，那么电信木棉卡真的超省心，激活有效期长达20年且不用续费，彻底告别后顾之忧！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>知友免费申请地址：</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2023流量卡推荐——电信木棉卡29元100G自选号码长期套餐</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>木棉卡专属查询链接：</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果自身需求还需要通话，那么可以看看下一款电信白杨卡，在木棉卡基础上还额外增加了100分钟！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>2.电信白杨卡（流量可全额结转，额外隐藏福利）</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3486075c7d044b9d92f4b93cd711e399_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>白杨卡做为木棉卡的调整版本，在木棉卡套餐基础上增加了100分钟免费通话，同时间接保留了二十年长期套餐，简直不要太爽！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>29月租享70G全国通用流量+30G全国定向流量+100分钟</strong>，超出套餐收费依旧是5元/G，0.1元/分钟，还可以通过续费实现长期套餐，性价比直接爆表；</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>首月免费，无协议期等电信标配也自然全部都有，下文有实测截图，且最重要的是，白杨卡根据实测可以<strong>实现流量全额结转。</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-071940e3fb44698c324ad352bf80ef83_r.jpg\" alt=\"\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">左右本人实测截图</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>知友免费申请链接</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>白杨卡本次预计上架5天左右，左右也特意向电信拿了免费的申请地址，<strong>不需要任何办理费用！</strong>但是，和以上几款卡情况相同，依旧是限量！！！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2023流量卡推荐——电信白杨卡29元100G100分钟长期套餐限时限量申请</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>每日限量300张，早申请早发货，单日满300则自动排至次日； 凡是在下架前成功提交申请，左右都尽可能给所有的小伙伴安排发货；</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n