\n<p>3.可以为自己公群聚集流量，提升活度；也可当TG机器人演示作用，<code>若他人有意购买本机器人可以私信你自己</code>。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><code>规格2：标准版</code></strong> <em><qc style=\"color:#09ACE2;background:undefined\"><strong>25U</strong></qc></em>/1个月</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1.出租形式，你自己无需服务器、无需域名、无需管理维护，有TG自助开通会员运营与限售权限，<code>单机器人权限归于你自己所有</code>，<code>联系客服为你自己</code>。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2.用户仅需提供TG机器人API、TG群链接与ID、个人TG链接与ID。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3.可以正常买卖会员充值，自己成本 自己定价；不仅可以为自己公群聚集流量，提升活度；也可当TG机器人演示作用，<code>若他人有意购买本机器人可以私信你自己</code>。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><code>规格3：个体商家版</code></strong> <strong><em><qc style=\"color:#09ACE2;background:undefined\">200U</qc></em></strong>/12个月，<strong><em><qc style=\"color:#09ACE2;background:undefined\">500U</qc></em></strong>/永久</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1.可以在自己服务器部署，可以查看源码，查看宝塔面板，管理面板后台</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2.用户需提供TG机器人API、TG群链接与ID、个人TG链接与ID、ton-key</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3.有单个机器人独立商家，可以正常买卖会员充值，自己成本 自己定价；不仅可以为自己公群聚集流量，提升活度；也可当TG机器人演示作用，<code>若他人有意购买本机器人可以私信你自己</code>。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><code>规格4：企业版</code></strong> <strong><em><qc style=\"color:#09ACE2;background:undefined\">900U</qc></em></strong>/永久</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1.可以任意给他人部署，买断形式，可以群控授权无限套机器人，可以在自己服务器部署，有单独源码，有教会部署与使用，查看宝塔面板，群控管理面板后台，单个管理面板后台</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2.用户需提供TG机器人API、TG群链接与ID、个人TG链接与ID、ton-key</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3.有独立群控多个授权机器人后台，有单个机器人独立可视化后台，独立商家，可以正常买卖会员充值，自己成本 自己定价；不仅可以为自己公群聚集流量，提升活度；也可当TG机器人演示作用，<code>若他人有意购买本机器人可以私信你自己</code>。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">ps -aux | grep web</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">sudo nohup ./webserver &amp;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">sudo nohup ./tgserver &amp;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">location  /api {\n      proxy_set_header Host $http_host;\n      proxy_set_header  X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n      proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n      proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;\n      rewrite ^/api/(.*)$ /$1 break;  #重写\n      proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:9998; # 设置代理服务器的协议和地址\n    }</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n<div data-type=\"payshow\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-hide-content\"><span>[hidecontent type=\"payshow\"]</span><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1.安装宝塔</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"884\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"884\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2.安装py管理器跟这堆</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1856,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20250303221115835-telegram-cloud-photo-size-5-6210817246444504597-y-1024x450.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1856\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1832,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20250303200136990-image-1024x484.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1832\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后点击进入py管理器-选择版本-安装3.9.7版本</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3.上传源码（更新到2025.3.3-v3.9.0版本）<br>新建文件夹</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1837,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20250303212614724-image-1024x490.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1837\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>进入文件夹使用URL链接下载源码 <br><a href=\"https://50.114.206.59:32152/down/r7rHS6xhxhpB.tar.gz\">https://50.114.206.59:32152/down/r7rHS6xhxhpB.tar.gz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1839,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20250303212700679-image-1024x512.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1839\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4.获取所需信息并填写</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>波龙API <a href=\"https://www.trongrid.io/\">https://www.trongrid.io/</a> 先注册-登陆-下载安装浏览器钱包扩展-绑定钱包-然后回到波龙首页连接钱包地址-升级50w访问-申请API</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>fragment官网登陆tg跟ton钱包-验证tg跟ton钱包<a href=\"https://fragment.com/\">https://fragment.com/</a>-首页点击会员界面-随便输入用户名@aaaa-然后回车</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1845,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20250303215305673-image-1024x546.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1845\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>点击查看浏览器右上角三个点</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1846,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20250303215344888-image-1024x666.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1846\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>点击网络-下面任意api开头的 点进去</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1849,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20250303215706855-telegram-cloud-photo-size-5-6210817246444504573-y-1024x666.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1849\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>复制hash跟cookie</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1852,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20250303220121704-telegram-cloud-photo-size-5-6210817246444504575-y-1024x666.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1852\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1853,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/20250303220154284-telegram-cloud-photo-size-5-6210817246444504591-y-1024x666.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1853\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5.回到源码hy.py文件的34、37、38、40行-和env跟config.py文件都需要修改填写好</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>6.导入数据库</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>7.回到宝塔首页-点击应用商店-进入py管理器-新建-选好路径-启动文件选hy.py</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><span>[/hidecontent]</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','TG自动化开会员机器人-TG会员销售自动充值','','publish','open','open','','tg%e8%87%aa%e5%8a%a8%e5%8c%96%e6%9c%ba%e5%99%a8%e4%ba%ba-tg%e4%bc%9a%e5%91%98%e9%94%80%e5%94%ae%e8%87%aa%e5%8a%a8%e5%85%85%e5%80%bc','','','2025-03-03 22:14:05','2025-03-03 14:14:05','',0,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1298',0,'post','',0),(1299,1,'2023-04-22 23:15:38','2023-04-22 15:15:38','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2333</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','TG自动化机器人-TG会员销售自动充值','','inherit','closed','closed','','1298-revision-v1','','','2023-04-22 23:15:38','2023-04-22 15:15:38','',1298,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1299',0,'revision','',0),(1300,1,'2023-04-23 12:45:00','2023-04-23 04:45:00','<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><br>FinalShell是一体化的的服务器,网络管理软件,不仅是ssh客户端,还是功能强大的开发,运维工具,充分满足开发,运维需求.<br><br>特色功能:<br>云端同步,免费海外服务器远程桌面加速,ssh加速,本地化命令输入框,支持自动补全,命令历史,自定义命令参数<br><br>Windows版下载地址:<br><a href=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/downloads/finalshell_install.exe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://www.hostbuf.com/downloads/finalshell_install.exe</a><br><br>macOS版下载地址:<br><a href=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/downloads/finalshell_install.pkg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://www.hostbuf.com/downloads/finalshell_install.pkg</a><br><br>mac版安装路径 /Applications/FinalShell.app/<br>配置文件路径 /Users/$USER/Library/FinalShell/<br>mac版卸载<br>删除安装目录 /Applications/FinalShell.app/<br><br>Linux版安装及教程:<br><a href=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/t/1059.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://www.hostbuf.com/t/1059.html</a><br><br>更新日志:<br><a href=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/t/989.html\">http://www.hostbuf.com/t/989.html</a><br><br>主要特性:<br>1.多平台支持Windows,macOS,Linux<br>2.多标签,批量服务器管理.<br>3.支持登录ssh和Windows远程桌面.<br>4.漂亮的平滑字体显示,内置100多个配色方案.<br>5.终端,sftp同屏显示,同步切换目录.<br>6.命令自动提示,智能匹配,输入更快捷,方便.<br>7.sftp支持,通过各种优化技术,加载更快,切换,打开目录无需等待.<br>8.服务器网络,性能实时监控,无需安装服务器插件.<br>9.内置海外服务器加速,加速远程桌面和ssh连接,操作流畅无卡顿.<br>10.内存,Cpu性能监控,Ping延迟丢包,Trace路由监控.<br>11.实时硬盘监控.<br>12.进程管理器.<br>13.快捷命令面板,可同时显示数十个命令.<br>14.内置文本编辑器,支持语法高亮,代码折叠,搜索,替换.<br>15.ssh和远程桌面均支持代理服务器.<br>16.打包传输,自动压缩解压.<br>17.支持rz,sz (zmodem)<br>18.多地点ping监控<br>19.命令输入框,支持自动补全,命令历史<br>20.自定义命令参数功能,可动态根据输入参数生成命令<br>21.可设置终端背景图片,并拥有动态背景模糊,文字阴影效果.<br>22.一键查看各种系统信息<br><br>更多功能会逐步增加,保持最少每周一次更新的频率,敬请关注.<br><br>界面截图:<br><img src=\"https://www.hostbuf.com/upload/image/20210110/1610264529229005910.jpg\" alt=\"QQ截图20210110154146.jpg\" width=\"626\" height=\"493\"><br><br><img alt=\"p2.png\" src=\"https://www.hostbuf.com/upload/image/20170117/1484635173334071105.png\" width=\"187\" height=\"119\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/upload/image/20170117/1484635245728075336.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/upload/image/20170117/1484635329540047793.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><br></a><br>查看系统消息<br><img src=\"https://www.hostbuf.com/upload/image/20210107/1609993908577098649.jpg\" alt=\"QQ截图20210107121929.jpg\" width=\"551\" height=\"410\"><br>进程管理器<br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/upload/image/20170426/1493144242449041493.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a><br>主机检测,Ping监控,Trace实时跟踪<br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/upload/image/20170426/1493144485765021287.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><br></a><br>高级网络监控,监控每个进程监听的端口,以及网络连接状态.<img src=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/upload/image/20171118/1511013349812005421.png\" alt=\"222.png\"><br><br>打包传输,自动压缩解压,适合传输大量文件,文件夹和文本文件.<br><img src=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/upload/image/20170924/1506183003447079520.png\" alt=\"z1.png\" width=\"318\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"http://www.hostbuf.com/upload/image/20170924/1506183014779017966.png\" alt=\"z2.png\" width=\"311\" height=\"181\"></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->','FinalShell-SSH连接/使用工具教程说明','','inherit','closed','closed','','1138-revision-v1','','','2023-04-23 12:45:00','2023-04-23 04:45:00','',1138,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1300',0,'revision','',0),(1301,1,'2023-04-23 16:33:19','2023-04-23 08:33:19','','TG自动发卡机器人 介绍部署教程','','inherit','closed','closed','','1280-revision-v1','','','2023-04-23 16:33:19','2023-04-23 08:33:19','',1280,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1301',0,'revision','',0),(1302,1,'2023-04-24 18:11:17','2023-04-24 10:11:17','<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><code>预计准备上新，敬请期待...</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','TG自动化机器人-TG会员销售自动充值','','inherit','closed','closed','','1298-revision-v1','','','2023-04-24 18:11:17','2023-04-24 10:11:17','',1298,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1302',0,'revision','',0),(1303,1,'2023-04-25 13:09:25','2023-04-25 05:09:25','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>即将上线</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','码支付搭建教程｜0基础小白搭建｜从入门到精通','','inherit','closed','closed','','557-revision-v1','','','2023-04-25 13:09:25','2023-04-25 05:09:25','',557,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1303',0,'revision','',0),(1305,1,'2023-04-26 15:44:49','2023-04-26 07:44:49','<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><code>演示：@AutoBuyEnergyBot</code><br>后端API平台为：<code><a href=\"https://fee.trxd.win\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://fee.trxd.win</a></code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682494933.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682494951.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682494960.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682494960.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682494960.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','波场能量租赁TG机器人','','inherit','closed','closed','','1278-revision-v1','','','2023-04-26 15:44:49','2023-04-26 07:44:49','',1278,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1305',0,'revision','',0),(1307,1,'2023-04-26 16:15:03','2023-04-26 08:15:03','<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><code>演示：<a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://t.me/EShopFakaBot\" target=\"_blank\">@EShopFakaBot</a></code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682496834.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','TG自动发卡机器人 介绍部署教程','','inherit','closed','closed','','1280-revision-v1','','','2023-04-26 16:15:03','2023-04-26 08:15:03','',1280,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1307',0,'revision','',0),(1308,1,'2023-04-26 16:15:32','2023-04-26 08:15:32','<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><code>演示：<a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://t.me/EShopFakaBot\" target=\"_blank\">@EShopFakaBot</a></code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682496834.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682496837.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','TG自动发卡机器人 介绍部署教程','','inherit','closed','closed','','1280-revision-v1','','','2023-04-26 16:15:32','2023-04-26 08:15:32','',1280,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1308',0,'revision','',0),(1309,1,'2023-11-15 02:01:30','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','供需发布TG机器人','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-11-15 02:01:30','2023-11-14 18:01:30','',0,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1309',0,'post','',0),(1310,1,'2023-04-26 16:24:05','2023-04-26 08:24:05','','供需发布TG机器人','','inherit','closed','closed','','1309-revision-v1','','','2023-04-26 16:24:05','2023-04-26 08:24:05','',1309,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1310',0,'revision','',0),(1311,1,'2025-06-27 01:49:55','2025-06-26 17:49:55','<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/20250702/70bcdc15290b3fd46402a10ecff5ff2a.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br><strong>🛡 专业记账机器人</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1.『基础设置』</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>① 添加机器人进群</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>② 设置操作人</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>③ 设置汇率发送 ” 设置汇率6.5 ”&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>设置费率/点位发送 ” 设置费率0 “&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2.『操作指令』</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>模式 切换记账或工资模式</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>100u &nbsp; 计算100USDT换算人民币</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>z100&nbsp; 计算100元人民币换算USDT【支付宝汇率】</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>w100&nbsp; 计算100元人民币换算USDT【微信汇率】</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>k100&nbsp; 计算100元人民币换算USDT【银行卡汇率】</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>设置操作人 设置操作人+回复操作人</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>移除操作人 移除操作人+回复操作人</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>下课 开启群禁言</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>上课 关闭群禁言</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>帮助 查看操作帮助</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3.『记账模式』</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>+1000&nbsp; 入款1000</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>-1000&nbsp; 出款1000</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>清除数据 删除当前账单</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>账单 查看账单</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>设置汇率6.8 表示设置u汇率6.8</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>显示U 打开U显示</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>隐藏U 关闭U显示</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4.『工资模式』&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>+100 增加100用户余额+回复用户</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>-100 减少100用户余额+回复用户</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1 查看用户余额【普通用户】</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2 查看群内所有用户余额</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5.『公群报备』&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>报备模板 查看报备模板</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>我的报备 查看群内所有我发起的审核通过的报备</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>全部报备 查看群内发起的审核通过的报备</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>清除报备 删除所有报备</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>订单编号 查看此订单编号的报备状态</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>dl+订单编号 结算此订单编号的报备</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6.『计算器』&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>+ - * /加减乘除符号 支持加减乘除运算，机器人会自动计算结果并发送消息</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>搭建教程</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n<div data-type=\"payshow\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-hide-content\"><span>[hidecontent type=\"payshow\"]</span><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>源码</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><span>[/hidecontent]</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->','【Telegram机器人】记账机器人系统','','publish','open','open','','%e8%ae%b0%e8%b4%a6tg%e6%9c%ba%e5%99%a8%e4%ba%ba','','','2025-07-02 01:14:34','2025-07-01 17:14:34','',0,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1311',0,'post','',0),(1312,1,'2023-04-26 16:24:25','2023-04-26 08:24:25','','记账TG机器人','','inherit','closed','closed','','1311-revision-v1','','','2023-04-26 16:24:25','2023-04-26 08:24:25','',1311,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1312',0,'revision','',0),(1313,1,'2023-04-26 21:28:55','2023-04-26 13:28:55','<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><code>演示：@AutoBuyEnergyBot</code><br>后端API平台为：<code><a href=\"https://fee.trxd.win\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://fee.trxd.win</a></code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682494933.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682494951.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230426/20230426_1682494960.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-b