e\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230516/20230516_1684177197.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt#%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E7%AE%80%E4%BB%8B\"></a>项目简介</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>Epusdt</code>（全称：Easy Payment Usdt）是一个由<code>Go语言</code>编写的私有化部署<code>Usdt</code>支付中间件(<code>Trc20网络</code>)<br>站长或开发者可通过<code>Epusdt</code>提供的<code>http api</code>集成至您的任何系统，无需过多的配置，仅仅依赖<code>mysql</code>和<code>redis</code><br>可实现USDT的在线支付和消息回调，这一切在优雅和顷刻间完成！?<br>私有化搭建使得无需额外的手续费和签约费用，Usdt代币直接进入您的钱包?<br><code>Epusdt</code>&nbsp;遵守&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html\">GPLv3</a>&nbsp;开源协议!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt#%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9\"></a>项目特点</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>支持私有化部署，无需担心钱包被篡改和吞单?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><code>Go语言</code>跨平台实现，支持x86和arm芯片架构的win/linux设备</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>多钱包地址轮询，提高订单并发率</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>异步队列响应，优雅及高性能</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>无需额外环境配置，仅运行一个编译后二进制文件即可使用</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>支持<code>http api</code>，其他系统亦可接入</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><code>Telegram</code>机器人接入，便捷使用和支付消息快速通知</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/alert -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-alert alert-dismissible fade in\"><div class=\"alert jb-blue\" data-isclose=\"\" role=\"alert\">如嫌麻烦，可购买本平台成品搭建好的：<strong><a href=\"https://store.hfz.pw/buy/3\" data-type=\"URL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">点击购买</a></strong></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/alert -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n<div data-type=\"payshow\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-hide-content\"><span>[hidecontent type=\"payshow\"]</span><!-- wp:zibllblock/iframe -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-iframe wp-block-embed is-type-video mb20\"><div class=\"\" style=\"padding-bottom:56%\"><iframe class=\"\" data-aspect=\"56%\" framespacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" frameborder=\"no\" src=\"//player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=264062948&amp;bvid=BV1Ge411c7QA&amp;cid=933427728&amp;page=1\"></iframe></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/iframe -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br><br>前言</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>本教程基于<code>宝塔</code>操作面板演示<code>Epusdt</code>如何运行，如果你未使用<code>宝塔</code>面板和有更强的服务器运维基础相信你也能根据教程的一些操作找到灵感！</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C\"></a>准备工作</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>一台Cetnos 7系统服务器。</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>电脑安装好SSH工具FS，服务器安装好国际版宝塔。</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>请确保已经安装并启动了<code>Mysql</code>和<code>redis</code>、<code>Supervisord</code>服务。</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>准备一个<code>telgeram</code>机器人?（用于操作你的钱包和接收交易通知），申请教程参考：<a href=\"https://w37fhy.cn/2364.html\">https://w37fhy.cn/2364.html</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>准备一个收银台域名，并完成解析(例如：<code>upay.dujiaoka.com</code>)。用于支付请求发起和扫码页面</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8\"></a>开始使用</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#%E4%B8%80%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99\"></a>一、新增网站</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>在<code>宝塔</code>面板网站里新增一个网站，无需<code>php</code>和<code>ftp</code>纯静态即可，但是需要数据库！<br>将提前解析好的收银台域名绑定。<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/img/add_web.png\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#%E4%BA%8C%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5sql\"></a>二、导入Sql</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>登录管理刚刚新增数据库，导入<code>Epusdt</code>所需的sql文件。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以下为示范0.01版本 最新数据库请以&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/sql/\">https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/sql/</a>&nbsp;为准</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#1%E6%89%8B%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5\"></a>1.手动下载导入</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>数据库地址:<a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/sql/v0.0.1.sql\">https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/sql/v0.0.1.sql</a>&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/img/sql.png\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#2%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8phpmyadmin%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5\"></a>2.使用phpMyAdmin导入</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>使用文本编辑器打开<code>.sql</code>文件，如下：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:preformatted -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\"><code>-- auto-generated definition\ncreate table orders\n(\n    id                   int auto_increment\n        primary key,\n    trade_id             varchar(32)    not null comment \'epusdt订单号\',\n    order_id             varchar(32)    not null comment \'客户交易id\',\n    block_transaction_id varchar(128)   null comment \'区块唯一编号\',\n    actual_amount        decimal(19, 4) not null comment \'订单实际需要支付的金额，保留4位小数\',\n    amount               decimal(19, 4) not null comment \'订单金额，保留4位小数\',\n    token                varchar(50)    not null comment \'所属钱包地址\',\n    status               int default 1  not null comment \'1：等待支付，2：支付成功，3：已过期\',\n    notify_url           varchar(128)   not null comment \'异步回调地址\',\n    redirect_url         varchar(128)   null comment \'同步回调地址\',\n    callback_num         int default 0  null comment \'回调次数\',\n    callback_confirm     int default 2  null comment \'回调是否已确认？ 1是 2否\',\n    created_at           timestamp      null,\n    updated_at           timestamp      null,\n    deleted_at           timestamp      null,\n    constraint orders_order_id_uindex\n        unique (order_id),\n    constraint orders_trade_id_uindex\n        unique (trade_id)\n);\n\ncreate index orders_block_transaction_id_index\n    on orders (block_transaction_id);\n\n-- auto-generated definition\ncreate table wallet_address\n(\n    id         int auto_increment\n        primary key,\n    token      varchar(50)   not null comment \'钱包token\',\n    status     int default 1 not null comment \'1:启用 2:禁用\',\n    created_at timestamp     null,\n    updated_at timestamp     null,\n    deleted_at timestamp     null\n)\n    comment \'钱包表\';\n\ncreate index wallet_address_token_index\n    on wallet_address (token);</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:preformatted -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>复制-粘贴至<code>phpmyadmin</code>的SQL面板，然后执行<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/img/run_sql.png\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#%E4%B8%89%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEepusdt\"></a>三、配置Epusdt</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1.将编译好的<code>Epusdt</code>项目压缩包上传至刚刚新增的网站目录，随后解压。<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/img/web_tree.png\"></a>&nbsp;2.将<code>.env.example</code>重命名为<code>.env</code>文件，这个是配置文件<br>3.编辑<code>.env</code>文件，填入你的配置</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">app_name=epusdt\n#下面配置你的域名，收银台会需要\napp_uri=https://upay.dujiaoka.com\n#是否开启debug，默认false\napp_debug=false\n#http服务监听端口\nhttp_listen=:8000\n\n#静态资源文件目录\nstatic_path=/static\n#缓存路径\nruntime_root_path=/runtime\n\n#日志配置\nlog_save_path=/logs\nlog_max_size=32\nlog_max_age=7\nmax_backups=3\n\n# mysql配置\nmysql_host=127.0.0.1\nmysql_port=3306\nmysql_user=mysql账号\nmysql_passwd=mysql密码\nmysql_database=数据库\nmysql_table_prefix=\nmysql_max_idle_conns=10\nmysql_max_open_conns=100\nmysql_max_life_time=6\n\n# redis配置\nredis_host=127.0.0.1\nredis_port=6379\nredis_passwd=\nredis_db=5\nredis_pool_size=5\nredis_max_retries=3\nredis_idle_timeout=1000\n\n# 消息队列配置\nqueue_concurrency=10\nqueue_level_critical=6\nqueue_level_default=3\nqueue_level_low=1\n\n#机器人Apitoken\ntg_bot_token=\n#telegram代理url(大陆地区服务器可使用一台国外服务器做反代tg的url)，如果运行的本来就是境外服务器，则无需填写\ntg_proxy=\n#管理员userid\ntg_manage=\n\n#api接口认证token(用于发起交易的签名认证，请勿外泄)\napi_auth_token=\n\n#订单过期时间(单位分钟)\norder_expiration_time=10\n\n#强制汇率(设置此参数后每笔交易将按照此汇率计算，例如:6.4)\nforced_usdt_rate=\n</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>⚠️注意：配置文件里面不认识的不要修改，留空即可，不会改又要瞎改，除非你对项目源代码很熟悉很有信心?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#%E5%9B%9B%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%91%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86\"></a>四、配置反向代理</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>由于<code>Epusdt</code>会自动开启<code>http</code>服务并监听配置端口，所以可以直接用ip访问，例如:&nbsp;<code>http://127.0.0.1:8000</code>。<br>这会显得非常不美观，还没有https。<br>所以我们需要借助nginx的<code>反向代理</code>来为<code>Epusdt</code>绑定一个域名<br>点击<code>宝塔</code>-&gt;<code>网站</code>-&gt;点击刚刚新增网站的<code>设置</code>-&gt;反向代理设置<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/img/fanxiang.png\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#%E4%BA%94%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%88epusdt%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90\"></a>五、赋予Epusdt执行权限</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>linux</code>服务器需要赋予<code>Epust</code>执行权限方可启动。<br>1.通过<code>ssh</code>进入服务器终端<br>2.进入<code>epusdt</code>可执行文件所在目录（目录位置可以参考宝塔面板的网站根目录）<br>3.执行命令<code>chmod +x epusdt</code>赋予权限(根据你的实际目录来，不用一比一抄我的，每个人的目录都不一样)<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/img/chmodx.png\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#%E5%85%AD%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEsupervisor\"></a>六、配置supervisor</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>为了保证<code>Epusdt</code>常驻后台运行，我们需要配置<code>supervisor</code>来实现进程监听<br>打开<code>宝塔supervisor</code>，添加守护进程<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/img/supervisor.png\"></a>&nbsp;启动命令为：epusdt所在目录+epusdt执行文件+空格+http+空格+start(例如：<code>/www/wwwroot/upay/epusdt-dev/epusdt http start</code>)<br>出现如下图则代表成功：<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/img/supervisor_success.png\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#%E4%B8%83%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95\"></a>七、测试</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>以上步骤完成无误后，进入<code>telegram</code>机器人?，如果机器人有反馈则代表运行正常！<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/img/epusdt_bot.png\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/assimon/epusdt/blob/master/wiki/BT_RUN.md#%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9\"></a>其他注意事项</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1.所有<code>.env</code>配置文件有了修改后都需要重启supervisor进程</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>2.教程所示的目录均为参考，请勿1:1照抄，根据自己实际情况来</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3.<code>windows</code>与<code>linux</code>不同，<code>windows</code>请直接运行<code>epusdt.exe</code>即可，无需赋予执行权限</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">安装包下载：</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/buttons -->\n<div data-quantity=\"1\" data-radius=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-buttons radius\"><span class=\"an_1 but hollow c-green\"><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-Epusdt/releases/tag/v0.0.3\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-Epusdt/releases/tag/v0.0.3\" target=\"_blank\">epusdt</a><a href=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-Epusdt/releases/tag/v0.0.3\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-Epusdt/releases/tag/v0.0.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">安装包</a><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-Epusdt/releases/tag/v0.0.3\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-Epusdt/releases/tag/v0.0.3\" target=\"_blank\">文件下载</a></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --><span>[/hidecontent]</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->','epusdt搭建｜USDT收款搭建','','inherit','closed','closed','','255-revision-v1','','','2023-05-16 03:00:32','2023-05-15 19:00:32','',255,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1364',0,'revision','',0),(1367,167,'2023-05-16 11:42:34','2023-05-16 03:42:34','','6a2f887530114234','','inherit','open','closed','','6a2f887530114234','','','2023-05-16 11:42:34','2023-05-16 03:42:34','',0,'https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/6a2f887530114234.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1369,1,'2023-05-19 23:37:34','2023-05-19 15:37:34','<!-- wp:zibllblock/alert -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-alert alert-dismissible fade in\"><div class=\"alert jb-blue\" data-isclose=\"\" role=\"alert\">如嫌搭建繁琐，可选择本平台搭建好的成品<strong><a href=\"https://store.hfz.pw/buy/8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">【点击购买】</a></strong></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/alert -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>CoinConvertBot是一个由C#语言编写的私有化部署USDT-TRC20全自动兑换TRX的机器人。</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>本项目不依赖任何外部资源，无需另外部署数据库，采用轻量化的sqlite，也无需redis。</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>可实现USDT-TRC20入账指定地址，自动向转账地址回款TRX，全程无需人工干预！? ? ?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>私有化搭建使得您的私钥?安全无比，同时USDT代币直接进入您的钱包?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>CoinConvertBot 遵守 GPLv3 开源协议!</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>支持私有化部署，无需担心钱包被盗?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>C#语言跨平台实现，支持x86和arm芯片架构的win/linux/mac设备</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>支持配置多个入账钱包地址，提高资金安全性</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>无需额外环境配置，仅运行一个编译后二进制文件即可使用</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Telegram大平台，更多客户，更便捷的使用和快速通知</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>CoinConvertBot\n    ├── src ---&gt; (项目核心目录）\n    └── wiki ---&gt; (知识库)</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>yum install -y wget &amp;&amp; wget -O install.sh http://www.aapanel.com/script/install_6.0_en.sh &amp;&amp; bash install.sh</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>{\n  \"Serilog\": {\n    \"MinimumLevel\": {\n      \"Default\": \"Information\",\n      \"Override\": {\n        \"Microsoft\": \"Warning\",\n        \"Microsoft.Hosting.Lifetime\": \"Information\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"AllowedHosts\": \"*\",\n  \"TronNet\": {\n    \"Host\": \"grpc.trongrid.io\",\n    \"ChannelPort\": 50051,\n    \"SolidityChannelPort\": 50052,\n    \"ApiKey\": \"69075******e28013\" //ApiKey，可以在此处申请：https://www.trongrid.io/dashboard/keys\n  },\n  \"TronConfig\": {\n    \"Address\": \"TKY******Qe\", //钱包地址，建议另外新建钱包地址，与下方私钥对应\n    \"PrivateKey\": \"972a9ab******fd067\", //私钥，建议另外新建钱包地址\n    \"USDTContractAddress\": \"TR7NHqjeKQxGTCi8q8ZY4pL8otSzgjLj6t\", //此为USDT合约地址，请勿修改！！！\n    \"ApiHost\": \"https://apilist.tronscan.org\"\n  },\n  \"ConnectionStrings\": {\n    \"DB\": \"Data Source=TG-CoinConvert.db;\"\n  },\n  \"Address\": {\n    \"USDT-TRC20\": &#91; \"******DARNYkq9Qe\"] //监听的USDT入账地址，同时也是展示给用户的转账地址，修改为你自己的地址，只有一个就只填写一个\n  },\n//  \"WebProxy\": \"http代理或socks5代理字符串，如：http://127.0.0.0:6666，如无需代理请去掉此项\",\n  \"BotConfig\": {\n    \"Token\": \"56******mUiWG_DGFH461Tf74k\",\n//    \"Proxy\": \"Telegram Api代理，如无，可去掉\",\n    \"AdminUserId\": 825512163, //管理员UserId，可至 @CoinConvertBot处发送/me获取\n    \"AdminUserUrl\": \"@ojbk0000\" //你的联系方式，可以是文字、@YourUserName、或t.me/YourUserName\n  },\n  \"MinToken\": {\n    \"USDT\": 5 //最小兑换USDT数量\n  },\n  \"FeeRate\": 0.1 //从最终用户获取的TRX中的抽成比例，默认10%\n}</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>CoinConvertBot的实现方式与其他项目原理类似都是通过监听TRC20网络的api或节点</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>监听钱包地址USDT代币入账事件将入账金额，根据汇率，扣除手续费后，转换为TRX</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>简单的原理：\n0.服务器定时同步交易所最新汇率\n1.客户支付20.05 USDT，交易上链\n2.服务器定时通过API轮询，获取监听地址下的最新USDT入账交易，并记录到数据库，标记为待处理\n3.定时任务读取数据库待处理的入账记录，读取数据库最新汇率，将USDT金额按照汇率转换为TRX金额\n4.使用配置的钱包转此金额的TRX到转出USDT的地址\n5.交易成功后通知客户(需要客户已经在机器人处绑定钱包地址)和管理员</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n<div data-type=\"payshow\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-hide-content\"><span>[hidecontent type=\"payshow\"]</span><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">宝塔运行</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-TRX-TG-#1-%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BDrelease%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%85%E8%A7%A3%E5%8E%8B%E5%88%B0%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95\"></a>1. 下载release对应平台的包，解压到指定目录<code><a href=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-TRX-TG-/raw/master/111.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">【下载地址】</a></code></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-TRX-TG-#2-%E9%87%8D%E5%91%BD%E5%90%8Dappsettingsexamplejson%E4%B8%BAappsettingsjson%E5%B9%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%8B%A5%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%AD%A4%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%AF%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E6%96%B0%E5%BB%BA\"></a>2. 重命名<code>appsettings.Example.json</code>为<code>appsettings.json</code>，并修改配置文件，若没有此文件，可自行新建</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>appsettings.json</code>说明参见：<a href=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-TRX-TG-/blob/33d572ea776277daadad9fa3072fff224f430ad1/%E7%BB%B4%E5%9F%BA/appsettings.Example.json\">appsettings.json</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-TRX-TG-#3-%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%8C%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6telegramcoinconvertbot%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E5%8F%AF%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90\"></a>3. 为二进制文件<code>Telegram.CoinConvertBot</code>增加可执行权限</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-TRX-TG-#4-%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%99%A8%E6%88%96supervisor%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%99%A8%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8\"></a>4.&nbsp;<code>宝塔应用管理器</code>或<code>Supervisor管理器</code>添加应用</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>应用名称：CoinConvertBot<br>应用环境：无 （<code>Supervisor管理器</code>无此项）<br>执行目录：/xxx (你解压文件的目录)<br>启动文件：/xxx/Telegram.CoinConvertBot<br>如有其他选项保持默认</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --><span>[/hidecontent]</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','【基础版】TRX自动兑换TG机器人搭建','','inherit','closed','closed','','409-revision-v1','','','2023-05-19 23:37:34','2023-05-19 15:37:34','',409,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1369',0,'revision','',0),(1370,1,'2023-05-20 01:23:05','2023-05-19 17:23:05','<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":\"600px\",\"height\":\"600px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230529/20230529_1685292304.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:600px;height:600px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/buttons {\"alignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div data-quantity=\"1\" data-radius=\"true\" style=\"text-align:center\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-buttons radius\"><span class=\"an_1 but hollow c-green\"><a href=\"https://store.hfz.pw/buy/84\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://store.hfz.pw/buy/84\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">点击购买代搭建</a></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><code>如需代部署，请联系客服，价格公道<a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://t.me/HFTGID\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://t.me/HFTGID\" target=\"_blank\">@HFTGID</a></code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">介绍：</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>演示机器人：<code><a href=\"https://t.me/HFTRXbot\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://t.me/HFTRXbot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">@HFTRX</a></code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>本版本兑币机为【高级版-自带按钮】，基础版为以下文章</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"409\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"409\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>本版本自带有：?实时汇率、?兑换地址、?预支trx、?‍♀代开会员、?实时OTC、?‍?联系老板，更多详细可以查看以下展示图/直接查看演示机器人：<code><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://t.me/HFTRXbot\" target=\"_blank\">@HFTRX</a></code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">部署教程：</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1.服务器</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"288\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"288\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2.SSH工具</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"1138\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"1138\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3.环境部署与源码上传</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->\n<div data-type=\"logged\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-hide-content\"><span>[hidecontent type=\"logged\"]</span><!-- wp:zibllblock/buttons {\"alignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div data-quantity=\"1\" data-radius=\"true\" style=\"text-align:center\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-buttons radius\"><span class=\"an_1 but hollow c-green\"><a href=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-Pro-TRXTGbot/blob/main/bot_2500.zip\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://github.com/cnmbdb/HF-Pro-TRXTGbot/blob/main/bot_2500.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">点击下载源码</a></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>连接服务器在root下执行</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">sudo apt update</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">sudo apt upgrade</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">sudo apt install build-essential zlib1g-dev libncurses5-dev libgdbm-dev libnss3-dev libssl-dev libreadline-dev libffi-dev wget</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">wget https://www.python.org/ftp/python/3.10.1/Python-3.10.1.tgz</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">tar -xf Python-3.10.1.tgz</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cd Python-3.10.1</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">./configure --enable-optimizations</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">make -j$(nproc)</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">sudo make altinstall</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>以下为在源码文件目录下执行</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">cd /www/wwwroot/trx</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter