-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://t.me/HFTGID\">点击下载源</a><a href=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/713d4e2029023202.zip\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://hfz.pw/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/713d4e2029023202.zip\">码</a></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>一、环境安装<br>系统要求<code>centos7.x</code><br><code>Nginx1.20 + PHP 7.2 + Mysql 5.6+Redis6.27+Supervisor 管理器</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>二、准备工作<br>准备好三个已经解析好的域名，分别为<code>前台域名，后台域名，云端域名。</code><br>服务器和宝塔放行 <code>82 和 5000</code> 端口</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>三、安装云端<br>①终端命令（命令行）：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">sudo rpm -Uvh https://packages.microsoft.com/config/rhel/7/packages-microsoft-prod.rpm</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2.完成后输入：<code>sudo yum install dotnet-sdk-3.1 </code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>【中途会有两次提示你输入，全部输入 y 回车即可】</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>②新建一个纯静态网站，填写云端域名。将云端文件上传并解压</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>③创建云端进程<br>进入软件商店，打开 Supervisor 管理器，添加守护进程，名称cloud，运行目录设置为云端网站路径<br>启动命令：<code>dotnet XMS.WeChat.Api.dll</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>四、创建后台网站<br>将后台源码上传解压，运行目录为 Public 伪静态：Thinkphp ，打开网站进行安装，安装完成</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>六、搭建前台网站<br>新建一个纯静态网站，将前台文件上传并解压，appsettings.json 文件内的数据库信息填写后台的数据库链接，<br>云端密钥信息填写如下：<br><code>\"CloudUrl\": \"http://云端域名:82\",<br>\"CloudKey\": \" \",<br>\"PayUrl\": \"http://ifengling.cn\",更改为你的后台域名<br>\"APIURL\": \"http://pay.ifengling.cn\"更改为你的前台域名</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>七、创建前台进程<br>进入软件商店，打开 Supervisor 管理器，添加守护进程，名称pay，运行目录设置为前台网站路径，启动命令为：<code>dotnet FrontPay.dll</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>八、设置好前台反向代理 目标 URL 为<code>【 http://你的域名:5000 】</code>发送域名为$host</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>九、验证码显示<br>将服务器根目录下 /etc/pki/tls/cert.pem 复制到/usr/local/openssl 然后重启一下守护进程<br>再执行以下命令<br><code>yum install -y libgdiplus-2.10-10.el7.x86_64</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>十、安装监控<br>宝塔计划任务</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>N分钟 1分钟</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter {\"linenumbers\":\"false\"} -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"false\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">#!/bin/bash \nstep=10 #间隔的秒数，不能大于60        \nfor (( i = 0; i &lt; 60; i=(i+step) )); do      \n    curl  -sS --connect-timeout 10 -m 60 \'https://前台域名/API/GeettingAsynAllPayCron\'      \n    echo \"----------------------------------------------------------------------------\"      \nendDate=`date +\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"`      \necho \"★\\\\\\\\\\\\\\[$endDate\\\\\\\\\\\\\\] Successful\"      \necho \"----------------------------------------------------------------------------\"      \n      \nsleep $step      \ndone      \nexit 0</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter --><span>[/hidecontent]</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/hide-content -->','2023最新源支付部署教程 | 0基础到精通','','inherit','closed','closed','','1470-revision-v1','','','2023-11-15 23:15:53','2023-11-15 15:15:53','',1470,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1535',0,'revision','',0),(1537,1,'2023-11-29 15:36:13','2023-11-29 07:36:13','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>环境部署</strong> Deban系统、宝塔默认扩展安装</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5033,\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter\"><a href=\"https://www.tuku68.com/5032.html/attachment/19084144675\"><img src=\"https://www.tuku68.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/19084144675.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5033\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5034,\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter\"><a href=\"https://www.tuku68.com/5032.html/attachment/19084214476\"><img src=\"https://www.tuku68.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/19084214476.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5034\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5035,\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter\"><a href=\"https://www.tuku68.com/5032.html/attachment/19084216639\"><img src=\"https://www.tuku68.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/19084216639.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5035\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5036,\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter\"><a href=\"https://www.tuku68.com/5032.html/attachment/19084217352\"><img src=\"https://www.tuku68.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/19084217352.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5036\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5037,\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter\"><a href=\"https://www.tuku68.com/5032.html/attachment/19084218443\"><img src=\"https://www.tuku68.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/19084218443.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5037\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5038,\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter\"><a href=\"https://www.tuku68.com/5032.html/attachment/19084220536\"><img src=\"https://www.tuku68.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/19084220536.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5038\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5039,\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter\"><a href=\"https://www.tuku68.com/5032.html/attachment/19084221494\"><img src=\"https://www.tuku68.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/19084221494.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5039\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":5040,\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter\"><a href=\"https://www.tuku68.com/5032.html/attachment/19084223501\"><img src=\"https://www.tuku68.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/19084223501.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5040\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1.购买服务器与域名</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"288\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"288\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2.SSH连接服务器</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"1138\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"1138\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3.域名托管至CF解析</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"859\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"859\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4.安装宝塔</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"884\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"884\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5.再次ssh连接服务器</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5.1.更新环境</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>apt update -y&nbsp; &amp;&amp; apt upgrade -y &amp;&amp; apt install -y curl wget sudo&nbsp;socat</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5.2.安装 Docker</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sh</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>curl -L \"https://github.com/docker/compose/releases/latest/download/docker-compose-$(uname -s)-$(uname -m)\" -o /usr/local/bin/docker-compose</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>chmod +x /usr/local/bin/docker-compose</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5.3.上传源码到站点并且修改配置文件</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><code>在大约第7 8行左右：root /xxx/xxxxx; 下面 增加以下内容 并点击：保存</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">    #域名绑定\n    location ^~ /\n    {\n        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8686;\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n        proxy_set_header REMOTE-HOST $remote_addr;\n    }\n    #wss配置\n    location /app/d44c681430dcbda971ca5c01ce2dfd1a\n    {\n        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:3011;\n        proxy_http_version 1.1;\n        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;\n        proxy_set_header Connection \"Upgrade\";\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n    }</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5.4.给予源码里该些文件777权限 <code>start</code> 、<code>reload</code> 、<code>stop</code> 、<code>del</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5.5.将【<strong>机器人源码</strong>】上传到网站根目录并解压出来，右键点击：<strong>.</strong><code><strong>env</strong>&nbsp;</code>编辑修改数据库配置</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">#数据库\nDB_NAME = ttt\n\n#数据库用户名\nDB_USER = ttt\n\n#数据库密码\nDB_PASSWORD = ttt\n\n#这是查询波场钱包地址数据时所必备的,自己去：https://tronscan.org/  注册一个账号后登录后创建一个APIKEY即可\nTRONSCAN_APIKEY = a3e4458e-3afc-222</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6.启动机器人</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>在终端输入命令：<code>./start</code>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>调试模式</strong>&nbsp;<strong>启动机器人</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; (首次部署推荐使用)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>在终端输入命令：<code>./start -d&nbsp;</code>&nbsp;<strong>后台模式</strong>&nbsp;<strong>启动机器人</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>在终端输入命令：<code>./reload</code>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>重新启动机器人</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>在终端输入命令：<code>./stop</code><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 停止机器人</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>在终端输入命令：<code>./del</code><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 选择清理数据或重新部署机器人</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->','焕新终极版TRX兑币机- TG机器人','','publish','open','open','','%e7%84%95%e6%96%b0%e7%bb%88%e6%9e%81%e7%89%88trx%e5%85%91%e5%b8%81%e6%9c%ba-tg%e6%9c%ba%e5%99%a8%e4%ba%ba','','','2024-05-13 14:40:21','2024-05-13 06:40:21','',0,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1537',0,'post','',0),(1538,1,'2023-11-16 18:08:17','2023-11-16 10:08:17','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>环境部署</strong></p>