-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"wznav_1\">2.能量兑换</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>可以自己质押获得能量，也可以自定义添加能量平台api，并且可以设置为轮询功能。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"wznav_2\">3.飞机会员</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>目前采用的是官方接口。会员套餐可针对不同会员平台设置不同的会员套餐</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"wznav_3\">4.监听钱包地址</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>监控包可以单独设置价格</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"wznav_4\">5.发卡系统</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>可以自定义添加各种商品。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>部署教程：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1.购买服务器与域名</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"288\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"288\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2.SSH连接服务器</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"1138\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"1138\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3.域名托管至CF解析</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"859\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"859\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4.安装宝塔</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"884\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"884\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Telegram五合一机器人-trx兑换-能量兑换-飞机会员-监听钱包-发卡系统','','inherit','closed','closed','','1560-revision-v1','','','2024-06-14 20:03:48','2024-06-14 12:03:48','',1560,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1660',0,'revision','',0),(1662,1,'2024-06-17 00:23:05','2024-06-16 16:23:05','<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":\"500px\",\"height\":\"500px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230320/20230320_1679253917.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:500px;height:500px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/buttons {\"alignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div data-quantity=\"1\" data-radius=\"true\" style=\"text-align:center\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-buttons radius\"><span class=\"an_1 but hollow c-blue\"><a href=\"https://store.hfz.pw/buy/76\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://store.hfz.pw/buy/76\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">前往代搭建成品购买</a></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"快速接入\">快速接入<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5\">​</a></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>目前OpenAI-HK主要提供GPT3.5和GPT4.0两种接口服务，需要支付费用后才可调用。用户可根据需求进行调用。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"调用方式\">调用方式<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>先通过&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.openai-hk.com/m/ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">openai-hk</a>注册一个帐号；</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>登录后，点击：【获取key】即可获得api-key;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>复制KEY&nbsp;返回的hk-开头的api_key，将原请求头中的api_key&nbsp;替换成我们专属的&nbsp;api_key<img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/h1.086ee373.png\" alt=\"cover\">例如：</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>原来: sk-sdiL2SMN4D7GBqFhBsYdT2345kFJhwEHGXbU5RzCM8dS3lrn</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>现在:&nbsp;hk-wsvj0oyeb0srl8b76xgzolc678996mhwlk3p3y7p3qo9wjdl</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>OpenAI&nbsp;的&nbsp;api_key&nbsp;通常以&nbsp;sk-&nbsp;作为开头，但我们平台的&nbsp;api_key&nbsp;以&nbsp;hk-&nbsp;开头&nbsp;后面是&nbsp;48&nbsp;位随机字符串</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>原请求地址&nbsp;api.openai.com的后面加上-hk，即&nbsp;api.openai-hk.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>例如：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>原来:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>现在:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"🔥对话接口实例\">🔥对话接口实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%94%A5%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%9D%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>实例是以对话(v1/chat/completions) 接口 作为样例；官方还有很多类型的结果</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>更多对话接口参数，请参考官网文档&nbsp;<a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat/create</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>下面为各位准备好多实例</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"curl-实例\">CURL 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#curl-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">curl --request POST \\\n  --url https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions \\\n  --header \'Authorization: Bearer hk-替换为你的key\' \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  --data \'{\n    \"max_tokens\": 1200,\n    \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.8,\n    \"top_p\": 1,\n    \"presence_penalty\": 1,\n    \"messages\": [\n        {\n            \"role\": \"system\",\n            \"content\": \"You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"role\": \"user\",\n            \"content\": \"你是chatGPT多少？\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\'</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"php-实例\">PHP 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#php-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">\n$ch = curl_init();\n\ncurl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_URL, \'https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\');\ncurl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER, 1);\ncurl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POST, 1);\n\n$headers = array();\n$headers[] = \'Content-Type: application/json\';\n$headers[] = \'Authorization: Bearer hk-替换为你的key\';\ncurl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER, $headers);\n\n$data = array(\n    \'max_tokens\' => 1200,\n    \'model\' => \'gpt-3.5-turbo\',\n    \'temperature\' => 0.8,\n    \'top_p\' => 1,\n    \'presence_penalty\' => 1,\n    \'messages\' => array(\n        array(\n            \'role\' => \'system\',\n            \'content\' => \'You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\'\n        ),\n        array(\n            \'role\' => \'user\',\n            \'content\' => \'你是chatGPT多少？\'\n        )\n    )\n);\n\n$data_string = json_encode($data);\n\ncurl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS, $data_string);\n\n$result = curl_exec($ch);\n\nif (curl_errno($ch)) {\n    echo \'Error:\' . curl_error($ch);\n}\n\ncurl_close($ch);\n\necho $result;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"python-实例\">Python 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#python-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">import requests\nimport json\n\nurl = \"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\"\n\nheaders = {\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n    \"Authorization\": \"Bearer hk-替换为你的key\"\n}\n\ndata = {\n    \"max_tokens\": 1200,\n    \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.8,\n    \"top_p\": 1,\n    \"presence_penalty\": 1,\n    \"messages\": [\n        {\n            \"role\": \"system\",\n            \"content\": \"You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"role\": \"user\",\n            \"content\": \"你是chatGPT多少？\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\nresponse = requests.post(url, headers=headers, data=json.dumps(data).encode(\'utf-8\') )\nresult = response.content.decode(\"utf-8\")\n\nprint(result)</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"javascript-实例\">javascript 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#javascript-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">const axios = require(\'axios\');\n\nconst url = \'https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\';\nconst headers = {\n  \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\',\n  \'Authorization\': \'Bearer hk-替换为你的key\'\n};\n\nconst data = {\n  max_tokens: 1200,\n  model: \'gpt-3.5-turbo\',\n  temperature: 0.8,\n  top_p: 1,\n  presence_penalty: 1,\n  messages: [\n    {\n      role: \'system\',\n      content: \'You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\'\n    },\n    {\n      role: \'user\',\n      content: \'你是chatGPT多少？\'\n    }\n  ]\n};\n\naxios.post(url, data, { headers })\n  .then(response => {\n    const result = response.data;\n    console.log(result);\n  })\n  .catch(error => {\n    console.error(error);\n  });</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"typescript-实例\">typescript 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#typescript-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">import axios from \'axios\';\n\nconst url = \'https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\';\nconst headers = {\n  \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\',\n  \'Authorization\': \'Bearer hk-替换为你的key\'\n};\n\nconst data = {\n  max_tokens: 1200,\n  model: \'gpt-3.5-turbo\',\n  temperature: 0.8,\n  top_p: 1,\n  presence_penalty: 1,\n  messages: [\n    {\n      role: \'system\',\n      content: \'You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\'\n    },\n    {\n      role: \'user\',\n      content: \'你是chatGPT多少？\'\n    }\n  ]\n};\n\naxios.post(url, data, { headers })\n  .then(response => {\n    const result = response.data;\n    console.log(result);\n  })\n  .catch(error => {\n    console.error(error);\n  });</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"java-实例\">java 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#java-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">import okhttp3.*;\n\nimport java.io.IOException;\n\npublic class OpenAIChat {\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        String url = \"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\";\n        \n        OkHttpClient client = new OkHttpClient();\n\n        MediaType mediaType = MediaType.parse(\"application/json\");\n\n        String json = \"{\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"max_tokens\\\": 1200,\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-3.5-turbo\\\",\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"temperature\\\": 0.8,\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"top_p\\\": 1,\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"presence_penalty\\\": 1,\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"messages\\\": [\\n\" +\n                \"    {\\n\" +\n                \"      \\\"role\\\": \\\"system\\\",\\n\" +\n                \"      \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\\\"\\n\" +\n                \"    },\\n\" +\n                \"    {\\n\" +\n                \"      \\\"role\\\": \\\"user\\\",\\n\" +\n                \"      \\\"content\\\": \\\"你是chatGPT多少？\\\"\\n\" +\n                \"    }\\n\" +\n                \"  ]\\n\" +\n                \"}\";\n\n        RequestBody body = RequestBody.create(mediaType, json);\n        Request request = new Request.Builder()\n                .url(url)\n                .post(body)\n                .addHeader(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n                .addHeader(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer hk-替换为你的key\")\n                .build();\n\n        Call call = client.newCall(request);\n        Response response = call.execute();\n        String result = response.body().string();\n        System.out.println(result);\n    }\n\n}</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"go-实例\">go 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#go-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>go</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">package main\n\nimport (\n	\"bytes\"\n	\"encoding/json\"\n	\"fmt\"\n	\"net/http\"\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n	url := \"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\"\n	apiKey := \"hk-替换为你的key\"\n\n	payload := map[string]interface{}{\n		\"max_tokens\":        1200,\n		\"model\":             \"gpt-3.5-turbo\",\n		\"temperature\":       0.8,\n		\"top_p\":             1,\n		\"presence_penalty\":  1,\n		\"messages\": []map[string]string{\n			{\n				\"role\":    \"system\",\n				\"content\": \"You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\",\n			},\n			{\n				\"role\":    \"user\",\n				\"content\": \"你是chatGPT多少？\",\n			},\n		},\n	}\n\n	jsonPayload, err := json.Marshal(payload)\n	if err != nil {\n		fmt.Println(\"Error encoding JSON payload:\", err)\n		return\n	}\n\n	req, err := http.NewRequest(\"POST\", url, bytes.NewBuffer(jsonPayload))\n	if err != nil {\n		fmt.Println(\"Error creating HTTP request:\", err)\n		return\n	}\n\n	req.Header.Set(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer \"+apiKey)\n	req.Header.Set(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n\n	client := &amp;http.Client{}\n	resp, err := client.Do(req)\n	if err != nil {\n		fmt.Println(\"Error making API request:\", err)\n		return\n	}\n	defer resp.Body.Close()\n\n	// 处理响应\n	// 请根据实际需求解析和处理响应数据\n	fmt.Println(\"Response HTTP Status:\", resp.StatusCode)\n}</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"🚀js实现sse打字效果\">🚀js实现sse打字效果<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%9A%80js%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0sse%E6%89%93%E5%AD%97%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>注意</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>可node.js 后端运行；也支持浏览器模式；需要注意的是如果是前端 注意保护好你的key。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如何保护好key？可以跟nginx 配合 将header 部分的 <code>\'Authorization\': \'Bearer hk-你的key\'</code> 放到 nginx当中</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">//记得引入 `axios`\nconst chatGPT=( msg, opt )=>{\n    let content=\'\'; \n    const dataPar=(data)=>{\n        let rz = {};\n        let dz= data.split(\'data:\',2);\n        const str = dz[1].trim();\n        if(str==\'[DONE]\') rz={ finish:true,text:\'\'};\n        else{\n            rz=JSON.parse(str); \n            rz.text= rz.choices[0].delta.content;\n        }\n        return rz ;\n    }\n    const dd= ( data )=>{\n        let arr = data.trim().split(\"\\n\\n\");\n        let rz={text:\'\',arr:[]};\n        const atext= arr.map(v=>{\n        const aa= dataPar(v);\n        return aa.text;\n        });\n        rz.arr= atext;\n        rz.text= atext.join(\"\");\n        if( opt.onMessage)  opt.onMessage(rz);\n        return rz ;\n    }\n    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n        axios({\n        method: \'post\',\n        url: \'https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\',\n        data: {\n            \"max_tokens\": 1200, \n            \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo\", //模型替换 如需调用4.0，改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可\n            \"temperature\": 0.8,\n            \"top_p\": 1,\n            \"presence_penalty\": 1,\n            \"messages\": [\n                {\n                    \"role\": \"system\",\n                    \"content\": opt.system??\"You are ChatGPT\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"role\": \"user\",\n                    \"content\": msg \n                }\n            ],\n            \"stream\": true //数据流方式输出\n        },\n        headers:{\n            \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\',\n            \'Authorization\': \'Bearer hk-你的key\'\n        },\n        onDownloadProgress: e=>dd(  e.target.responseText)\n        })\n        .then(d=>  resolve(dd(d.data) ))\n        .catch(e=> reject(e ) );\n\n    })   \n}\n\n//调用\nchatGPT( \'你是谁？\' \n  ,{\n      //system:\'\', //角色定义\n      onMessage: d=> console.log(\'过程性结果：\',d.text  ) \n    }\n).then( d=> console.log(\'✅最终结果：\', d ) ).catch( e=>  console.log(\'❎错误：\', e )  );</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"😁embeddings-接口\">😁embeddings 接口<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%98%81embeddings-%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>请求地址： POST&nbsp;<a href=\"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/embeddings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/embeddings</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>node.js 请求实例</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">const fetch = require(\"node-fetch\");\n\nfetch(\"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/embeddings\", {\n method: \"POST\",\n headers: {\n   Authorization: \"Bearer hk-替换为你的key\",\n   \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n },\n body: JSON.stringify({\n   input: \"一起来使用ChatGPT\",\n   model: \"text-embedding-ada-002\",\n }),\n});</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"😁moderations-接口\">😁moderations 接口<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%98%81moderations-%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>请求地址： POST&nbsp;<a href=\"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/moderations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/moderations</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>node.js 请求实例</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>js</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">const fetch = require(\"node-fetch\");\n\nfetch(\"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/moderations\", {\n method: \"POST\",\n headers: {\n   Authorization: \"Bearer hk-替换为你的key\",\n   \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n },\n body: JSON.stringify({ input: \"有人砍我\" }),\n});</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"😁各种应用\">😁各种应用<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%98%81%E5%90%84%E7%A7%8D%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>现实中有好多应用，可以选择一种你喜欢的</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"chatgpt-web\">chatgpt-web<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#chatgpt-web\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>docker 启动 默认模型是gpt-3.5</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">docker run --name chatgpt-web -d -p 6011:3002 \\\n--env OPENAI_API_KEY=hk-替换为你的key \\\n--env TIMEOUT_MS=600000  --env OPENAI_MAX_TOKEN=1000 \\\n--env OPENAI_API_BASE_URL=https://api.openai-hk.com  chenzhaoyu94/chatgpt-web</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后访问&nbsp;<a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:6011/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://127.0.0.1:6011</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"chatgpt-web-gpt-4\">chatgpt-web gpt-4<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#chatgpt-web-gpt-4\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>默认模型是gpt-3.5 如何起一个默认模型 gpt-4.0 呢? 使用环境变量 <code>OPENAI_API_MODEL</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">docker run --name chatgpt-web -d -p 6040:3002 \\\n--env OPENAI_API_KEY=hk-替换为你的key \\\n--env TIMEOUT_MS=600000  --env OPENAI_MAX_TOKEN=1000 \\\n--env OPENAI_API_MODEL=gpt-4-0613 \\\n--env OPENAI_API_BASE_URL=https://api.openai-hk.com  chenzhaoyu94/chatgpt-web</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后访问&nbsp;<a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:6040/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://127.0.0.1:6040</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"可选模型有哪些\">可选模型有哪些<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%9C%89%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>模型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>gpt-3.5-turbo-0613</td><td>3.5的4k 上下文支持到4k</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-3.5-turbo-16k-0613</td><td>3.5的16k 能够支持更长的上下文 价格比普通3.5贵些</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-3.5-turbo-1106</td><td>3.5的16k 价格与3.5 4k一样</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-4</td><td>8k的4.0 上下文支持到8k</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-4-0613</td><td>4.0的0613版本</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-4-1106-preview</td><td>128k的4.0 价格是普通gpt-4的一半</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-4-vision-preview</td><td>token价格跟 gpt-4-1106-preview 一样，支持4k, 有额外的图片费用</td></tr><tr><td>dall-e-3</td><td>openai的画图</td></tr><tr><td>Midjourney</td><td>非openai的画图产品</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>看效果<img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/web1.c5f841bf.png\" alt=\"cover\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"chatgpt-next-web\">chatgpt-next-web<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#chatgpt-next-web\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">docker run  --name chatgpt-next-web   -d -p 6013:3000 \\\n   -e OPENAI_API_KEY=\"hk-替换为你的key\" \\\n   -e BASE_URL=https://api.openai-hk.com   yidadaa/chatgpt-next-web</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后访问&nbsp;<a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:6013/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://127.0.0.1:6013</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>看效果</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/web2.ad3a357b.png\" alt=\"cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"其他\">其他<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果还有其应用 请联系我们客服协助</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"🚀直接使用\">🚀直接使用<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%9A%80%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"_1、chatgpt-web-多模型自由切换\">1、chatgpt web 多模型自由切换<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#_1%E3%80%81chatgpt-web-%E5%A4%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%88%87%E6%8D%A2\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>注意</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1.访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://chat.ddaiai.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a><a href=\"https://chat.ddaiai.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://chat.ddaiai.com/</a>&nbsp;(如果被墙，请换用将二级域名&nbsp;<code>chat</code>更换为&nbsp;<code>hi</code>)<br>2.如果发现被墙了 可以自己换地址&nbsp;<code>https://hello.ddaiai.com</code>&nbsp;把&nbsp;<code>hello</code>&nbsp;换其他的 如&nbsp;<code>https://202312.ddaiai.com</code>&nbsp;都能访问</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>设置</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">然后在下图相应的地方设置\nOpenAi接口地址: https://api.openai-hk.com\nOpenAi API KEY: hk-你的apiKey \n\n如果想画图 把midjourney的资料也完善\nmidjourney 接口地址: https://api.openai-hk.com\nmidjourney Api Secret: hk-你的apiKey</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/mj3a2.b49731a5.jpg\" alt=\"cover\"><strong>效果</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>输入框 提问对话<img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/mj3a1.a470364a.jpg\" alt=\"cover\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>模型切换</strong>&nbsp;支持自定义模型，多个可以用逗号隔开<img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/mj3a4.c3bf8bc4.jpg\" alt=\"cover\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"_2、next-web-多模型自由切换\">2、next-web 多模型自由切换<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#_2%E3%80%81next-web-%E5%A4%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%88%87%E6%8D%A2\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>注意</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1.访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://web.ccaiai.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a><a href=\"https://web.ccaiai.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://web.ccaiai.com/</a>&nbsp;(需要科学)<br>2.如果发现被墙了 可以自己换地址&nbsp;<code>https://suibian.ccaiai.com</code>&nbsp;把&nbsp;<code>suibian</code>&nbsp;换其他的 如&nbsp;<code>https://abc.ccaiai.com</code>&nbsp;都能访问</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">然后在下图相应的地方设置\n接口地址：https://api.openai-hk.com\nAPI KEY: hk-你的apiKey\n模型：选择 GPT-4</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/help3.05f15a64.jpg\" alt=\"cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>输入框 提问对话</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/help4.522e1589.jpg\" alt=\"cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','Chat GPT专属网站部署｜搭建个人/企业版ChatGPT网站｜搭建部署教程介绍','','inherit','closed','closed','','956-revision-v1','','','2024-06-17 00:23:05','2024-06-16 16:23:05','',956,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1662',0,'revision','',0),(1665,1,'2024-06-17 15:02:26','2024-06-17 07:02:26','<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":\"500px\",\"height\":\"500px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230320/20230320_1679253917.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:500px;height:500px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/buttons {\"alignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div data-quantity=\"1\" data-radius=\"true\" style=\"text-align:center\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-buttons radius\"><span class=\"an_1 but hollow c-blue\"><a href=\"https://store.hfz.pw/buy/76\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://store.hfz.pw/buy/76\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">前往代搭建成品购买</a></span></div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"快速接入\">快速接入<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5\">​</a></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>目前OpenAI-HK主要提供GPT3.5和GPT4.0两种接口服务，需要支付费用后才可调用。用户可根据需求进行调用。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"调用方式\">调用方式<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>先通过&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.openai-hk.com/m/ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">openai-hk</a>注册一个帐号；</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>登录后，点击：【获取key】即可获得api-key;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>复制KEY&nbsp;返回的hk-开头的api_key，将原请求头中的api_key&nbsp;替换成我们专属的&nbsp;api_key<img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/h1.086ee373.png\" alt=\"cover\">例如：</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>原来: sk-sdiL2SMN4D7GBqFhBsYdT2345kFJhwEHGXbU5RzCM8dS3lrn</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>现在:&nbsp;hk-wsvj0oyeb0srl8b76xgzolc678996mhwlk3p3y7p3qo9wjdl</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>OpenAI&nbsp;的&nbsp;api_key&nbsp;通常以&nbsp;sk-&nbsp;作为开头，但我们平台的&nbsp;api_key&nbsp;以&nbsp;hk-&nbsp;开头&nbsp;后面是&nbsp;48&nbsp;位随机字符串</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>原请求地址&nbsp;api.openai.com的后面加上-hk，即&nbsp;api.openai-hk.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>例如：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>原来:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>现在:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"🔥对话接口实例\">🔥对话接口实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%94%A5%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%9D%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>实例是以对话(v1/chat/completions) 接口 作为样例；官方还有很多类型的结果</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>更多对话接口参数，请参考官网文档&nbsp;<a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat/create</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>下面为各位准备好多实例</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"curl-实例\">CURL&nbsp;实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#curl-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">curl --request POST \\\n  --url https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions \\\n  --header \'Authorization: Bearer hk-替换为你的key\' \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  --data \'{\n    \"max_tokens\": 1200,\n    \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.8,\n    \"top_p\": 1,\n    \"presence_penalty\": 1,\n    \"messages\": [\n        {\n            \"role\": \"system\",\n            \"content\": \"You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"role\": \"user\",\n            \"content\": \"你是chatGPT多少？\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\'</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"php-实例\">PHP 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#php-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">\n$ch = curl_init();\n\ncurl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_URL, \'https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\');\ncurl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER, 1);\ncurl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POST, 1);\n\n$headers = array();\n$headers[] = \'Content-Type: application/json\';\n$headers[] = \'Authorization: Bearer hk-替换为你的key\';\ncurl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER, $headers);\n\n$data = array(\n    \'max_tokens\' => 1200,\n    \'model\' => \'gpt-3.5-turbo\',\n    \'temperature\' => 0.8,\n    \'top_p\' => 1,\n    \'presence_penalty\' => 1,\n    \'messages\' => array(\n        array(\n            \'role\' => \'system\',\n            \'content\' => \'You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\'\n        ),\n        array(\n            \'role\' => \'user\',\n            \'content\' => \'你是chatGPT多少？\'\n        )\n    )\n);\n\n$data_string = json_encode($data);\n\ncurl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS, $data_string);\n\n$result = curl_exec($ch);\n\nif (curl_errno($ch)) {\n    echo \'Error:\' . curl_error($ch);\n}\n\ncurl_close($ch);\n\necho $result;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"python-实例\">Python 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#python-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">import requests\nimport json\n\nurl = \"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\"\n\nheaders = {\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n    \"Authorization\": \"Bearer hk-替换为你的key\"\n}\n\ndata = {\n    \"max_tokens\": 1200,\n    \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo\",\n    \"temperature\": 0.8,\n    \"top_p\": 1,\n    \"presence_penalty\": 1,\n    \"messages\": [\n        {\n            \"role\": \"system\",\n            \"content\": \"You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"role\": \"user\",\n            \"content\": \"你是chatGPT多少？\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\nresponse = requests.post(url, headers=headers, data=json.dumps(data).encode(\'utf-8\') )\nresult = response.content.decode(\"utf-8\")\n\nprint(result)</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"javascript-实例\">javascript 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#javascript-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">const axios = require(\'axios\');\n\nconst url = \'https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\';\nconst headers = {\n  \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\',\n  \'Authorization\': \'Bearer hk-替换为你的key\'\n};\n\nconst data = {\n  max_tokens: 1200,\n  model: \'gpt-3.5-turbo\',\n  temperature: 0.8,\n  top_p: 1,\n  presence_penalty: 1,\n  messages: [\n    {\n      role: \'system\',\n      content: \'You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\'\n    },\n    {\n      role: \'user\',\n      content: \'你是chatGPT多少？\'\n    }\n  ]\n};\n\naxios.post(url, data, { headers })\n  .then(response => {\n    const result = response.data;\n    console.log(result);\n  })\n  .catch(error => {\n    console.error(error);\n  });</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"typescript-实例\">typescript 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#typescript-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">import axios from \'axios\';\n\nconst url = \'https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\';\nconst headers = {\n  \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\',\n  \'Authorization\': \'Bearer hk-替换为你的key\'\n};\n\nconst data = {\n  max_tokens: 1200,\n  model: \'gpt-3.5-turbo\',\n  temperature: 0.8,\n  top_p: 1,\n  presence_penalty: 1,\n  messages: [\n    {\n      role: \'system\',\n      content: \'You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\'\n    },\n    {\n      role: \'user\',\n      content: \'你是chatGPT多少？\'\n    }\n  ]\n};\n\naxios.post(url, data, { headers })\n  .then(response => {\n    const result = response.data;\n    console.log(result);\n  })\n  .catch(error => {\n    console.error(error);\n  });</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"java-实例\">java 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#java-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">import okhttp3.*;\n\nimport java.io.IOException;\n\npublic class OpenAIChat {\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        String url = \"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\";\n        \n        OkHttpClient client = new OkHttpClient();\n\n        MediaType mediaType = MediaType.parse(\"application/json\");\n\n        String json = \"{\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"max_tokens\\\": 1200,\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-3.5-turbo\\\",\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"temperature\\\": 0.8,\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"top_p\\\": 1,\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"presence_penalty\\\": 1,\\n\" +\n                \"  \\\"messages\\\": [\\n\" +\n                \"    {\\n\" +\n                \"      \\\"role\\\": \\\"system\\\",\\n\" +\n                \"      \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\\\"\\n\" +\n                \"    },\\n\" +\n                \"    {\\n\" +\n                \"      \\\"role\\\": \\\"user\\\",\\n\" +\n                \"      \\\"content\\\": \\\"你是chatGPT多少？\\\"\\n\" +\n                \"    }\\n\" +\n                \"  ]\\n\" +\n                \"}\";\n\n        RequestBody body = RequestBody.create(mediaType, json);\n        Request request = new Request.Builder()\n                .url(url)\n                .post(body)\n                .addHeader(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n                .addHeader(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer hk-替换为你的key\")\n                .build();\n\n        Call call = client.newCall(request);\n        Response response = call.execute();\n        String result = response.body().string();\n        System.out.println(result);\n    }\n\n}</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"go-实例\">go 实例<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#go-%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>go</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">package main\n\nimport (\n	\"bytes\"\n	\"encoding/json\"\n	\"fmt\"\n	\"net/http\"\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n	url := \"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\"\n	apiKey := \"hk-替换为你的key\"\n\n	payload := map[string]interface{}{\n		\"max_tokens\":        1200,\n		\"model\":             \"gpt-3.5-turbo\",\n		\"temperature\":       0.8,\n		\"top_p\":             1,\n		\"presence_penalty\":  1,\n		\"messages\": []map[string]string{\n			{\n				\"role\":    \"system\",\n				\"content\": \"You are ChatGPT, a large language model trained by OpenAI. Answer as concisely as possible.\",\n			},\n			{\n				\"role\":    \"user\",\n				\"content\": \"你是chatGPT多少？\",\n			},\n		},\n	}\n\n	jsonPayload, err := json.Marshal(payload)\n	if err != nil {\n		fmt.Println(\"Error encoding JSON payload:\", err)\n		return\n	}\n\n	req, err := http.NewRequest(\"POST\", url, bytes.NewBuffer(jsonPayload))\n	if err != nil {\n		fmt.Println(\"Error creating HTTP request:\", err)\n		return\n	}\n\n	req.Header.Set(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer \"+apiKey)\n	req.Header.Set(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n\n	client := &amp;http.Client{}\n	resp, err := client.Do(req)\n	if err != nil {\n		fmt.Println(\"Error making API request:\", err)\n		return\n	}\n	defer resp.Body.Close()\n\n	// 处理响应\n	// 请根据实际需求解析和处理响应数据\n	fmt.Println(\"Response HTTP Status:\", resp.StatusCode)\n}</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如需调用4.0，可将上面modle中 gpt-3.5-turbo改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"🚀js实现sse打字效果\">🚀js实现sse打字效果<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%9A%80js%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0sse%E6%89%93%E5%AD%97%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>注意</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>可node.js 后端运行；也支持浏览器模式；需要注意的是如果是前端 注意保护好你的key。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如何保护好key？可以跟nginx 配合 将header 部分的&nbsp;<code>\'Authorization\': \'Bearer hk-你的key\'</code>&nbsp;放到 nginx当中</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">//记得引入 `axios`\nconst chatGPT=( msg, opt )=>{\n    let content=\'\'; \n    const dataPar=(data)=>{\n        let rz = {};\n        let dz= data.split(\'data:\',2);\n        const str = dz[1].trim();\n        if(str==\'[DONE]\') rz={ finish:true,text:\'\'};\n        else{\n            rz=JSON.parse(str); \n            rz.text= rz.choices[0].delta.content;\n        }\n        return rz ;\n    }\n    const dd= ( data )=>{\n        let arr = data.trim().split(\"\\n\\n\");\n        let rz={text:\'\',arr:[]};\n        const atext= arr.map(v=>{\n        const aa= dataPar(v);\n        return aa.text;\n        });\n        rz.arr= atext;\n        rz.text= atext.join(\"\");\n        if( opt.onMessage)  opt.onMessage(rz);\n        return rz ;\n    }\n    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n        axios({\n        method: \'post\',\n        url: \'https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/chat/completions\',\n        data: {\n            \"max_tokens\": 1200, \n            \"model\": \"gpt-3.5-turbo\", //模型替换 如需调用4.0，改为gpt-4或gpt-4-0613即可\n            \"temperature\": 0.8,\n            \"top_p\": 1,\n            \"presence_penalty\": 1,\n            \"messages\": [\n                {\n                    \"role\": \"system\",\n                    \"content\": opt.system??\"You are ChatGPT\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"role\": \"user\",\n                    \"content\": msg \n                }\n            ],\n            \"stream\": true //数据流方式输出\n        },\n        headers:{\n            \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\',\n            \'Authorization\': \'Bearer hk-你的key\'\n        },\n        onDownloadProgress: e=>dd(  e.target.responseText)\n        })\n        .then(d=>  resolve(dd(d.data) ))\n        .catch(e=> reject(e ) );\n\n    })   \n}\n\n//调用\nchatGPT( \'你是谁？\' \n  ,{\n      //system:\'\', //角色定义\n      onMessage: d=> console.log(\'过程性结果：\',d.text  ) \n    }\n).then( d=> console.log(\'✅最终结果：\', d ) ).catch( e=>  console.log(\'❎错误：\', e )  );</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"😁embeddings-接口\">😁embeddings 接口<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%98%81embeddings-%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>请求地址： POST&nbsp;<a href=\"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/embeddings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/embeddings</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>node.js 请求实例</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">const fetch = require(\"node-fetch\");\n\nfetch(\"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/embeddings\", {\n method: \"POST\",\n headers: {\n   Authorization: \"Bearer hk-替换为你的key\",\n   \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n },\n body: JSON.stringify({\n   input: \"一起来使用ChatGPT\",\n   model: \"text-embedding-ada-002\",\n }),\n});</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"😁moderations-接口\">😁moderations 接口<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%98%81moderations-%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>请求地址： POST&nbsp;<a href=\"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/moderations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/moderations</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>node.js 请求实例</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">const fetch = require(\"node-fetch\");\n\nfetch(\"https://api.openai-hk.com/v1/moderations\", {\n method: \"POST\",\n headers: {\n   Authorization: \"Bearer hk-替换为你的key\",\n   \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n },\n body: JSON.stringify({ input: \"有人砍我\" }),\n});</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"😁各种应用\">😁各种应用<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%98%81%E5%90%84%E7%A7%8D%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>现实中有好多应用，可以选择一种你喜欢的</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"chatgpt-web\">chatgpt-web<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#chatgpt-web\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>docker 启动 默认模型是gpt-3.5</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">docker run --name chatgpt-web -d -p 6011:3002 \\\n--env OPENAI_API_KEY=hk-替换为你的key \\\n--env TIMEOUT_MS=600000  --env OPENAI_MAX_TOKEN=1000 \\\n--env OPENAI_API_BASE_URL=https://api.openai-hk.com  chenzhaoyu94/chatgpt-web</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后访问&nbsp;<a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:6011/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://127.0.0.1:6011</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"chatgpt-web-gpt-4\">chatgpt-web gpt-4<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#chatgpt-web-gpt-4\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>默认模型是gpt-3.5 如何起一个默认模型 gpt-4.0 呢? 使用环境变量&nbsp;<code>OPENAI_API_MODEL</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">docker run --name chatgpt-web -d -p 6040:3002 \\\n--env OPENAI_API_KEY=hk-替换为你的key \\\n--env TIMEOUT_MS=600000  --env OPENAI_MAX_TOKEN=1000 \\\n--env OPENAI_API_MODEL=gpt-4-0613 \\\n--env OPENAI_API_BASE_URL=https://api.openai-hk.com  chenzhaoyu94/chatgpt-web</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后访问&nbsp;<a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:6040/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://127.0.0.1:6040</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"可选模型有哪些\">可选模型有哪些<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%9C%89%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>模型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>gpt-3.5-turbo-0613</td><td>3.5的4k 上下文支持到4k</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-3.5-turbo-16k-0613</td><td>3.5的16k 能够支持更长的上下文 价格比普通3.5贵些</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-3.5-turbo-1106</td><td>3.5的16k 价格与3.5 4k一样</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-4</td><td>8k的4.0 上下文支持到8k</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-4-0613</td><td>4.0的0613版本</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-4-1106-preview</td><td>128k的4.0 价格是普通gpt-4的一半</td></tr><tr><td>gpt-4-vision-preview</td><td>token价格跟 gpt-4-1106-preview 一样，支持4k, 有额外的图片费用</td></tr><tr><td>dall-e-3</td><td>openai的画图</td></tr><tr><td>Midjourney</td><td>非openai的画图产品</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>看效果<img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/web1.c5f841bf.png\" alt=\"cover\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"chatgpt-next-web\">chatgpt-next-web<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#chatgpt-next-web\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">docker run  --name chatgpt-next-web   -d -p 6013:3000 \\\n   -e OPENAI_API_KEY=\"hk-替换为你的key\" \\\n   -e BASE_URL=https://api.openai-hk.com   yidadaa/chatgpt-next-web</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>然后访问&nbsp;<a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:6013/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://127.0.0.1:6013</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>看效果</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/web2.ad3a357b.png\" alt=\"cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"其他\">其他<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>如果还有其应用 请联系我们客服协助</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"🚀直接使用\">🚀直接使用<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#%F0%9F%9A%80%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8\">​</a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"_1、chatgpt-web-多模型自由切换\">1、chatgpt web 多模型自由切换<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#_1%E3%80%81chatgpt-web-%E5%A4%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%88%87%E6%8D%A2\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>注意</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1.访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://chat.ddaiai.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a><a href=\"https://chat.ddaiai.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://chat.ddaiai.com/</a>&nbsp;(如果被墙，请换用将二级域名&nbsp;<code>chat</code>更换为&nbsp;<code>hi</code>)<br>2.如果发现被墙了 可以自己换地址&nbsp;<code>https://hello.ddaiai.com</code>&nbsp;把&nbsp;<code>hello</code>&nbsp;换其他的 如&nbsp;<code>https://202312.ddaiai.com</code>&nbsp;都能访问</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>设置</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">然后在下图相应的地方设置\nOpenAi接口地址: https://api.openai-hk.com\nOpenAi API KEY: hk-你的apiKey \n\n如果想画图 把midjourney的资料也完善\nmidjourney 接口地址: https://api.openai-hk.com\nmidjourney Api Secret: hk-你的apiKey</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/mj3a2.b49731a5.jpg\" alt=\"cover\"><strong>效果</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>输入框 提问对话<img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/mj3a1.a470364a.jpg\" alt=\"cover\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>模型切换</strong>&nbsp;支持自定义模型，多个可以用逗号隔开<img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/mj3a4.c3bf8bc4.jpg\" alt=\"cover\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"_2、next-web-多模型自由切换\">2、next-web 多模型自由切换<a href=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/getting-started.html#_2%E3%80%81next-web-%E5%A4%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%88%87%E6%8D%A2\">​</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>注意</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1.访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://web.ccaiai.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a><a href=\"https://web.ccaiai.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://web.ccaiai.com/</a>&nbsp;(需要科学)<br>2.如果发现被墙了 可以自己换地址&nbsp;<code>https://suibian.ccaiai.com</code>&nbsp;把&nbsp;<code>suibian</code>&nbsp;换其他的 如&nbsp;<code>https://abc.ccaiai.com</code>&nbsp;都能访问</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-enlighter\"><code class=\"gl\" data-enlighter-language=\"generic\" data-enlighter-theme=\"\" data-enlighter-highlight=\"\" data-enlighter-linenumbers=\"\" data-enlighter-lineoffset=\"\" data-enlighter-title=\"\" data-enlighter-group=\"\">然后在下图相应的地方设置\n接口地址：https://api.openai-hk.com\nAPI KEY: hk-你的apiKey\n模型：选择 GPT-4</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/enlighter -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/help3.05f15a64.jpg\" alt=\"cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>输入框 提问对话</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"http://www.openai-hk.com/docs/assets/help4.522e1589.jpg\" alt=\"cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->','Chat GPT专属网站部署｜搭建个人/企业版ChatGPT网站｜搭建部署教程介绍','','inherit','closed','closed','','956-revision-v1','','','2024-06-17 15:02:26','2024-06-17 07:02:26','',956,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1665',0,'revision','',0),(1666,1,'2024-06-17 16:36:30','2024-06-17 08:36:30','<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20240323/20240323_1711123515.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><code>⚠️注意：最新版2024.6.15已经更新，本平台已经将原作者留的后面深度隔离删除，已经完全修复，本平台购买的官方版本用户可进行更新，外面市场的同类别款式机器人造成的损失与本平台无关，全网独家 各位擦亮眼睛 不要被骗！</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong><code>单源码500U</code></strong>(不手把手教会部署，单纯源码，保证完整)<br><strong><code>部署一套1000U</code></strong>(不手把手教会部署，但教会使用)，5个功能可散卖，<strong><code>一个功能225U</code></strong><br><strong><code>教会无限部署1850U</code></strong>(手把手教会部署，以及教会使用)，5个功能可散卖，<strong><code>一个功能550U</code></strong><br><br>telegram五合一机器人全开源无任何加密，并且有php的后台，目前开发了以下功能：1.trx兑换。2.能量兑换，3.飞机会员，4.监听钱包，5.发卡系统。机器人的命令，键盘设置，关键词回复，定时广告均可以自定义。以上功能都可以添加多个机器人。下面是图文演示：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20240614/20240614_1718366559.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>机器人设置相关：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"wznav_0\">1.trx兑换usdt，usdt兑换TRX。</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"wznav_1\">2.能量兑换</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>可以自己质押获得能量，也可以自定义添加能量平台api，并且可以设置为轮询功能。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"wznav_2\">3.飞机会员</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>目前采用的是官方接口。会员套餐可针对不同会员平台设置不同的会员套餐</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"wznav_3\">4.监听钱包地址</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>监控包可以单独设置价格</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"wznav_4\">5.发卡系统</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>可以自定义添加各种商品。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>部署教程：</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1.购买服务器与域名</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"288\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"288\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2.SSH连接服务器</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"1138\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"1138\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3.域名托管至CF解析</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"859\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"859\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4.安装宝塔</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n<div data-pid=\"884\" class=\"wp-block-zibllblock-postsbox\">[postsbox post_id=\"884\"]</div>\n<!-- /wp:zibllblock/postsbox -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Telegram五合一机器人-trx兑换-能量兑换-飞机会员-监听钱包-发卡系统','','inherit','closed','closed','','1560-revision-v1','','','2024-06-17 16:36:30','2024-06-17 08:36:30','',1560,'https://hfz.pw/?p=1666',0,'revision','',0),(1668,1,'2024-06-17 21:29:35','2024-06-17 13:29:35','<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://input-s3.mn.input.im/donate-group/7/20230318/20230318_1679083640.png\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\"><code><strong>英特尔芯片服务器</strong></code></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\"><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1.活动爆